window.LK_VEHICULES = [{"id":"albany-emperor","nom":"Emperor","marque":"Albany","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Cadillac Sedan de Ville 1977-1980","src":"Official screenshots","search":"albany emperor cadillac sedan de ville 1977-1980","txt":"Albany has always been the brand of big, plush American cars, and the Emperor is the archetype: long hood, thick rear pillar, soft suspension. The 1977-1980 Cadillac Sedan de Ville whose look it borrows was an aging boss’s car that, over the years, became the quintessential used sedan, the one you find rusting in working-class neighborhoods. The screenshots released by Rockstar show it parked along a Vice City curb.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cadillac%20Sedan%20de%20Ville","reelNom":"Cadillac Sedan de Ville","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-emperor.svg"},{"id":"albany-primo","nom":"Primo","marque":"Albany","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"late-80s Pontiac Bonneville","src":"Trailer 1","search":"albany primo pontiac bonneville fin des annees 80","txt":"The Primo has a special place in the series: a no-frills sedan that’s mechanically sound, it’s the customizers’ favorite base. The late-80s Pontiac Bonneville that inspired it was a big mass-market American car, built in huge numbers and resold cheap a decade later, which made it a top choice for South Florida’s lowrider culture. Trailer 1 shows it driving by in a street shot.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Pontiac%20Bonneville%20fin%20des%20ann%C3%A9es%2080","reelNom":"late-80s Pontiac Bonneville","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-primo.svg"},{"id":"albany-primo-custom","nom":"Primo Custom","marque":"Albany","cat":"berline","st":"comm","insp":"Buick Regal","src":"Community match","search":"albany primo custom buick regal","txt":"Same body as the Primo, done up as a lowrider: lowered suspension, thin wire wheels, effect paint. It’s the variant that fits Vice City best, where the Cuban and Puerto Rican lowrider scene is a strong cultural marker. The Rideout Customs shop, visible on our map, is the kind of place where this sort of build would happen. Model not confirmed by Rockstar for Leonida.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Regal","reelNom":"Buick Regal","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-primo-custom.svg"},{"id":"benefactor-schafter-v12","nom":"Schafter V12","marque":"Benefactor","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Brabus E V12","src":"Trailer 1","search":"benefactor schafter v12 brabus e v12","txt":"The Schafter V12 is a Benefactor sports sedan. The match we picked here is the Brabus E V12. It shows up in Trailer 1 under a community identification; Rockstar doesn’t give its name there.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Brabus%20E%20V12","reelNom":"Brabus E V12","thumb":"/img/schemas/benefactor-schafter-v12.svg"},{"id":"karin-asterope","nom":"Asterope","marque":"Karin","cat":"berline","st":"comm","insp":"Previous-generation Toyota Camry","txt":"A Japanese family sedan, the best-selling car in its segment in the US for decades. The newer GZ variant is already in this database.","search":"karin asterope toyota camry generation precedente","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20Camry%20pr%C3%A9c%C3%A9dente","reelNom":"previous-generation Toyota Camry","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-asterope.svg"},{"id":"karin-asterope-gz","nom":"Asterope GZ","marque":"Karin","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Toyota Camry (XV30)","src":"Official screenshots","search":"karin asterope gz toyota camry (xv30)","txt":"Karin is the GTA universe’s mainstream Japanese brand, and the Asterope is its everyman car. The Toyota Camry that inspires it has been the best-selling sedan in the US for decades, precisely because it never draws attention. The GZ suffix suggests a slightly higher trim. It shows up in the official screenshots, lost in Leonida’s everyday traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20Camry%20(XV30)","reelNom":"Toyota Camry (XV30)","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-asterope-gz.svg"},{"id":"lampadati-feroci","nom":"Feroci","marque":"Karin","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"First-generation Lexus GS 300","txt":"The Feroci takes after the first-generation Lexus GS 300, designed by Giugiaro and launched in 1993. It was Toyota’s attempt to plant a premium sports sedan against the German cars: flawless build quality, an inline-six, and a low profile that cost it in the showrooms. Karin is the GTA universe’s Toyota, which makes the attribution consistent.","search":"karin feroci lexus gs 300 premiere generation","src":"Extended Look","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lexus%20GS%20300","reelNom":"Lexus GS 300","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/lampadati-feroci.svg"},{"id":"karin-intruder","nom":"Intruder","marque":"Karin","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Infiniti Q45/I30","src":"Trailer 1","search":"karin intruder infiniti q45/i30","txt":"The Intruder is modeled on the Infiniti Q45 and I30, the upscale sedans Nissan launched in the US to take on Lexus. The bet never really paid off: well built and comfortable, but with no strong identity next to the German cars. The result: today you find them used and cheap, exactly the kind of car that fills Vice City’s parking lots without anyone giving it a second look.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Infiniti%20Q45%2FI30","reelNom":"Infiniti Q45/I30","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-intruder.svg"},{"id":"audi-a7-rs7","nom":"A7 RS7","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Audi RS7","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A high-performance German four-door coupe-sedan with a sloping roofline. The RS7 is the archetype of the fast car that doesn’t get noticed: five hundred horsepower under the body of a sales executive’s sedan. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue a7 rs7 audi rs7 deuxieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Audi%20RS7","reelNom":"Audi RS7","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/audi-a7-rs7.svg"},{"id":"honda-accord-10","nom":"Accord","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Tenth-generation Honda Accord","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A mass-market Japanese sedan, tenth generation. The Accord is one of the best-selling cars in US history, to the point of becoming invisible in the urban landscape. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue accord honda accord dixieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20Accord%20dixi%C3%A8me","reelNom":"tenth-generation Honda Accord","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/honda-accord-10.svg"},{"id":"mercedes-c-w205","nom":"C-Class","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"A German compact sedan from the W205 generation, built from 2014 to 2021. It’s the model that made the Mercedes star mainstream, and the ultimate company car across the Western world. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue classe c mercedes-benz classe c w205","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20Classe%20C%20W205","reelNom":"Mercedes-Benz C-Class W205","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/mercedes-c-w205.svg"},{"id":"chevrolet-impala-10","nom":"Impala","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Tenth-generation Chevrolet Impala","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A full-size American sedan from the 2000s, the last generation with front-wheel drive. Bought in bulk by fleets, rental companies and government agencies, it’s the very definition of an anonymous car. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue impala chevrolet impala dixieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Impala%20dixi%C3%A8me","reelNom":"tenth-generation Chevrolet Impala","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chevrolet-impala-10.svg"},{"id":"volkswagen-jetta","nom":"Jetta","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Volkswagen Jetta","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A German compact sedan, the three-box version of the Golf, very popular in the US, where hatchbacks don’t sell well. Spotted in the Extended Look. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue jetta volkswagen jetta","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Volkswagen%20Jetta","reelNom":"Volkswagen Jetta","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/volkswagen-jetta.svg"},{"id":"chrysler-lebaron-town-country","nom":"LeBaron Town & Country","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Chrysler LeBaron Town & Country 1986-1988","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A family station wagon with fake wood-paneled sides, spotted in the Extended Look. This walnut-look vinyl trim is an American tradition that goes back to the 1940s, and Chrysler kept it going into the 1980s. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue lebaron town & country chrysler lebaron town & country 1986-1988","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chrysler%20LeBaron%20Town%20%26%20Country","reelNom":"Chrysler LeBaron Town & Country","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chrysler-lebaron-town-country.svg"},{"id":"oceanic","nom":"Oceanic","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"comm","insp":"Chevrolet Bel Air 1950","txt":"A postwar American sedan with rounded fenders and a two-piece windshield. It belongs to the generation before tailfins, the one of the first big migrations to Florida.","search":"marque inconnue oceanic chevrolet bel air 1950","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Bel%20Air%201950","reelNom":"Chevrolet Bel Air 1950","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/oceanic.svg"},{"id":"buick-regal-6","nom":"Regal","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Buick Regal","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A mid-range American sedan from the 2010s, derived from a European Opel. Back then, Buick was trying to win younger buyers over from an aging customer base, without really pulling it off. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue regal buick regal sixieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Regal","reelNom":"Buick Regal","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buick-regal-6.svg"},{"id":"chrysler-sebring-dodge-stratus","nom":"Sebring","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Chrysler Sebring","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A mass-market sedan from the late 2000s, twin of the Dodge Stratus. Often named as one of the least successful American cars of its time, which didn’t stop it from filling rental fleets. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue sebring chrysler sebring deuxieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chrysler%20Sebring","reelNom":"Chrysler Sebring","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chrysler-sebring-dodge-stratus.svg"},{"id":"buick-skylark-6","nom":"Skylark","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Buick Skylark","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"A compact American sedan from the 80s, mass-produced in huge numbers on General Motors’ X platform. These cars aged badly and now end up on the streets of working-class neighborhoods, which fits Leonida’s setting well. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue skylark buick skylark sixieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Skylark","reelNom":"Buick Skylark","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buick-skylark-6.svg"},{"id":"chevrolet-sonic","nom":"Sonic","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Sonic","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"The Chevrolet Sonic, an entry-level subcompact sold by the hundreds of thousands in the United States. A modest four-cylinder, a bare-bones cabin: it’s the first-paycheck car, or the rental-fleet car. Rockstar hasn’t given it an in-game name yet. Trailer 1 shows it stopped at a light, among the everyday cars.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Sonic","reelNom":"Chevrolet Sonic","search":"marque inconnue sonic chevrolet sonic","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chevrolet-sonic.svg"},{"id":"ford-taurus","nom":"Taurus","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Taurus","src":"Extended Look","txt":"An American family sedan, one of Ford’s biggest sales hits of the 80s and 90s. Its rounded body caused a stir when it came out, then became the industry standard. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue taurus ford taurus","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Taurus","reelNom":"Ford Taurus","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-taurus.svg"},{"id":"obey-tailgater","nom":"Tailgater","marque":"Obey","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Audi A6","src":"Trailer 1","search":"obey tailgater audi a6","txt":"Obey is the series’ German premium brand, and the Tailgater is its entry-level sedan, the one for the executive who’s starting to make it. The Audi A6 that inspires it is a sober, all-wheel-drive cruiser, built to eat up the miles without any thrills. A profile that fits the business districts of Downtown. Trailer 1 shows it briefly, for the length of a traffic shot.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Audi%20A6","reelNom":"Audi A6","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/obey-tailgater.svg"},{"id":"obey-tailgater-s","nom":"Tailgater S","marque":"Obey","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Audi RS3 Sedan","src":"Official screenshots","search":"obey tailgater s audi rs3 sedan","txt":"A longer, better-equipped version of the Tailgater, along the lines of an Audi A4 versus an A6: same design language, more length, more discreet chrome. It’s the executive sedan, the one with a chauffeur. The official screenshots single it out, sitting on its stock wheels.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Audi%20RS3%20Sedan","reelNom":"Audi RS3 Sedan","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/obey-tailgater-s.svg"},{"id":"schyster-pmp-700","nom":"PMP 700","marque":"Schyster","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Chrysler 300","src":"Trailer 1","search":"schyster pmp 700 chrysler 300 deuxieme generation","txt":"The PMP 700 is a chauffeur-driven executive sedan, in the vein of the big long-wheelbase German sedans. This kind of car handles transfers between the airport and the beachfront hotels, a huge amount of traffic in Miami. Trailer 1 frames it from the rear three-quarter view, idling in a line of cars.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-027"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-027":"Large green sedan in the right foreground, GTA VI Trailer 1 at 00:27"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chrysler%20300","reelNom":"Chrysler 300","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-027-480.webp"},{"id":"vapid-stanier-moderne","nom":"Stanier","marque":"Vapid","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Crown Victoria","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"The modern Stanier, not to be confused with the Ultimate Edition’s Stanier ’55. It’s based on the Ford Crown Victoria, the rear-wheel-drive, body-on-frame sedan that served as America’s police car and taxi for more than twenty years. Indestructible, heavy, and instantly recognizable.","search":"vapid stanier ford crown victoria","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Crown%20Victoria","reelNom":"Ford Crown Victoria","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-stanier-moderne.svg"},{"id":"vapid-stanier","nom":"Stanier ’55","marque":"Vapid","cat":"berline","st":"officiel","insp":"1956 Ford Fairlane Club Sedan","src":"Trailer 1","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"vapid stanier ’55 1956 ford fairlane club sedan","txt":"The Stanier ’55 is one of the few vehicles whose name Rockstar has published, in the Vintage Vice City Pack. Our official screenshots show the two-tone yellow and cream body, the tail fins, the disc hubcaps and the cursive script badge on the fender. The 1955 Ford Fairlane whose lines it borrows belongs to that postwar generation when American cars started to look like airplanes. A logical pick for a city that loves its nostalgia.","edition":"Pre-Order","medias":["55-vapid-stanier-01","55-vapid-stanier-02","55-vapid-stanier-03","55-vapid-stanier-04"],"vuesDeclarees":["profil","arriere","interieur","detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=1956%20Ford%20Fairlane%20Club%20Sedan","reelNom":"1956 Ford Fairlane Club Sedan","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/55-vapid-stanier-01-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-stratum","nom":"Stratum","marque":"Zirconium","cat":"berline","st":"vu","insp":"Honda Accord station wagon","txt":"A mass-produced family station wagon with a vertical tailgate and roof rails. The Stratum is the ultimate background vehicle: everywhere, noticed nowhere, and so perfect when you don’t want to get spotted.","search":"zirconium stratum honda accord station wagon","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20Accord%20station%20wagon","reelNom":"Honda Accord station wagon","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-stratum.svg"},{"id":"albany-manana","nom":"Manana","marque":"Albany","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Buick LeSabre, Cadillac Eldorado","src":"Official screenshots","search":"albany manana buick lesabre, cadillac eldorado","txt":"The Manana is a ’70s American personal luxury coupe: two doors, vinyl roof, front bench seat. The series has always treated it as a neighborhood car, often seen in lowrider form. Its oversized body for just two seats sums up the era that made it pretty well. The official screenshots show it at a tuner’s shop, ready for paint.","medias":["rideout-customs-mod-shop-01","ultimate-edition-rideout-customs-02","ultimate-edition-rideout-customs-03"],"imageAlts":{"ultimate-edition-rideout-customs-02":"Red interior of the car shown in the Rideout Customs screenshot series","ultimate-edition-rideout-customs-03":"Raised yellow coupe in the Rideout Customs shop, identified as an Albany Manana"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20LeSabre","reelNom":"Buick LeSabre","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/rideout-customs-mod-shop-01-480.webp"},{"id":"albany-v-str","nom":"V-STR","marque":"Albany","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"2019 Cadillac CTS-V","src":"Official screenshots","search":"albany v-str 2019 cadillac cts-v","txt":"The V-STR is Albany’s attempt at a modern sports car, which is a bit of a stretch for a brand known for big American cruisers. The name recalls the three-letter badges Cadillac turned into its signature on its performance models. The official screenshots show it parked, grille in full view.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=2019%20Cadillac%20CTS-V","reelNom":"2019 Cadillac CTS-V","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-v-str.svg"},{"id":"annis-elegy-retro-custom","nom":"Elegy Retro Custom","marque":"Annis","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Nissan Skyline GT-R","src":"Trailer 1","search":"annis elegy retro custom nissan skyline gt-r","txt":"The Elegy is the series’ tuning icon, and its Retro Custom version is the most sought-after one. The Nissan Skyline R32 that inspired it is a monument of Japanese car culture: all-wheel drive, an inline-six engine, and total dominance in racing that earned it the nickname Godzilla. The Custom suffix means a widebody kit and a spoiler. Trailer 1 sends it down an avenue, shot at headlight height.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Nissan%20Skyline%20GT-R","reelNom":"Nissan Skyline GT-R","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/annis-elegy-retro-custom.svg"},{"id":"benefactor-schafter-lwb","nom":"Schafter LWB","marque":"Benefactor","cat":"sport","st":"comm","insp":"long-wheelbase Mercedes-Benz E-Class","txt":"The long-wheelbase version of the Schafter, built for the back seat rather than the driver. In Leonida, it’s the car for people who get driven around: Vice City hotels, the airport, nights out.","search":"benefactor schafter lwb mercedes-benz classe e allongee","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20Classe%20E%20allong%C3%A9e","reelNom":"long-wheelbase Mercedes-Benz E-Class","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/benefactor-schafter-lwb.svg"},{"id":"bravado-banshee","nom":"Banshee","marque":"Bravado","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Viper","src":"Trailer 2","search":"bravado banshee dodge viper","txt":"The Banshee has been a series staple since Vice City, with a shape instantly linked to the Dodge Viper. The fifth-generation Dodge Viper, whose proportions it borrows, is a brutal car: a truck V10 in a narrow chassis, without the electronic aids that make modern sports cars easy to tame. The Banshee shows up in Trailer 2, with no name announced by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Viper","reelNom":"Dodge Viper","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-banshee.svg"},{"id":"bravado-buffalo","nom":"Buffalo","marque":"Bravado","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Charger","src":"Trailer 1","search":"bravado buffalo dodge charger","txt":"Bravado is the brand of American muscle cars, and the Buffalo is its sports sedan: four doors, big engine, stiff chassis. In earlier games, the police used it as much as the gangs did, which says a lot about where it stands. Trailer 1 shows it driving through Vice City traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Charger","reelNom":"Dodge Charger","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-buffalo.svg"},{"id":"bravado-buffalo-s","nom":"Buffalo S","marque":"Bravado","cat":"sport","st":"comm","insp":"Dodge Charger SRT8","txt":"The sporty version of the Buffalo: more aggressive side skirts, hood scoop, solid wheels. On the real Charger, this version marked the comeback of the four-door American muscle car in the 2010s.","search":"bravado buffalo s dodge charger srt8","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Charger%20SRT8","reelNom":"Dodge Charger SRT8","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-buffalo-s.svg"},{"id":"coil-raiden","nom":"Raiden","marque":"Coil","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Tesla Model S","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Coil’s electric sedan, modeled on the Tesla Model S: no grille, flush door handles, full torque the moment you lift your foot off the brake. It’s the car of Leonida’s well-off neighborhoods. The official screenshots show it plugged into a charging station.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Tesla%20Model%20S","reelNom":"Tesla Model S","search":"coil raiden tesla model s","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/coil-raiden.svg"},{"id":"declasse-mamba-gt","nom":"Mamba GT","marque":"Declasse","cat":"sport","st":"officiel","insp":"Shelby Daytona Coupe","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"declasse mamba gt shelby daytona coupe","txt":"The Mamba GT is one of the models Rockstar named in the Ultimate Edition lineup. The Shelby Daytona Coupe whose look it borrows is a race car born from a constraint: making an open-top Cobra aerodynamic enough to hold its own on the long straight at the 24 Hours of Le Mans. The result, with its chopped tail and raked windshield, won the world championship in 1965. Only six were ever built.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["classic-car-collection-04"],"vuesDeclarees":["detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Shelby%20Daytona%20Coup%C3%A9","reelNom":"Shelby Daytona Coupe","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/classic-car-collection-04-480.webp"},{"id":"dinka-blista-compact","nom":"Blista Compact","marque":"Dinka","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"First-generation Honda CR-X","src":"Official screenshots","search":"dinka blista compact honda cr-x premiere generation","txt":"Dinka is this universe’s Honda, and the Blista Compact is its sporty city car. The formula is well known: small light car, punchy engine, front-wheel drive, affordable price. It’s the kind of vehicle that fills the streets rather than collectors’ garages. The official screenshots place it along a residential street.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20CR-X","reelNom":"Honda CR-X","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/dinka-blista-compact.svg"},{"id":"dinka-sugoi","nom":"Sugoi","marque":"Dinka","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Honda Civic Type R FK8","src":"Official screenshots","search":"dinka sugoi honda civic type r fk8","txt":"A compact sedan with a sporty streak, the Sugoi has a name that simply means “awesome” in Japanese, which says a lot about the series’ sense of humor. It belongs to that family of production cars you can turn into track machines with a few parts. The official screenshots show it with its wing up, ready for the straight.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20Civic%20R%20FK8","reelNom":"Honda Civic R FK8","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/dinka-sugoi.svg"},{"id":"cheval-vectre","nom":"Vectre","marque":"Emperor","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Lexus RC F","src":"Trailer 2","search":"emperor vectre lexus rc f","txt":"Emperor is the upscale Japanese brand of the GTA universe, and the Vectre is its compact sports coupe. The name sounds like a shortened “vector”, the kind of aerodynamic-sounding name automakers loved in the 90s. Trailer 2 slips it into a shot of city traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lexus%20RC%20F","reelNom":"Lexus RC F","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/cheval-vectre.svg"},{"id":"enus-paragon-r","nom":"Paragon R","marque":"Enus","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"2018 Bentley Continental GT","src":"Official screenshots","search":"enus paragon r 2018 bentley continental gt","txt":"The Paragon R takes after the 2018 Bentley Continental GT: a four-seat coupe, a W12 under the hood, and a weight no suspension can quite make you forget. It’s grand touring in the literal sense, the car that crosses a continent in one go. The R suffix marks the sharper version.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=2018%20Bentley%20Continental%20GT","reelNom":"2018 Bentley Continental GT","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/enus-paragon-r.svg"},{"id":"enus-windsor","nom":"Windsor","marque":"Enus","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Rolls-Royce Wraith","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"Enus’s ultra-luxury coupe, copied from the Rolls-Royce Wraith: coach doors, an endless hood, an upright grille set like a temple front. It’s the car you park in front of a hotel so people see you step out of it. Trailer 2 catches it in profile.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Rolls-Royce%20Wraith","reelNom":"Rolls-Royce Wraith","search":"enus windsor rolls-royce wraith","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/enus-windsor.svg"},{"id":"fathom-fr36","nom":"FR36","marque":"Fathom","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Infiniti G35 (V35)","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Fathom’s coupe takes after the first-generation Infiniti G35, a rear-wheel-drive Japanese car that became a tuning classic thanks to its six-cylinder engine and balanced chassis. The Extended Look frames it in a workshop, hood up.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Infiniti%20G35%20(V35)","reelNom":"Infiniti G35 (V35)","search":"fathom fr36 infiniti g35 (v35)","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/fathom-fr36.svg"},{"id":"grotti-carbonizzare","nom":"Carbonizzare","marque":"Grotti","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Ferrari F12berlinetta and Aston Martin V12 Zagato","src":"Trailer 1","search":"grotti carbonizzare ferrari f12berlinetta et aston martin v12 zagato","txt":"Grotti is the series’ Ferrari, and the Carbonizzare is its front-engined grand tourer. The Ferrari F12 it’s modeled on is a road car like no other: a naturally aspirated V12 with over seven hundred horsepower, in a body sculpted to channel the air rather than slice through it. Trailer 1 shows it in a quick drive-by.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-025"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-025":"Red convertible with a female passenger standing up, GTA VI Trailer 1 at 00:25"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferrari%20F12berlinetta","reelNom":"Ferrari F12berlinetta","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-025-480.webp"},{"id":"grotti-cheetah-classic","nom":"Cheetah ’95","marque":"Grotti","cat":"sport","st":"officiel","insp":"Ferrari Testarossa and 512 BB","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"grotti cheetah ’95 ferrari testarossa et 512 bb","txt":"Rockstar names the Cheetah ’95 in the Ultimate Edition lineup, and our four official screenshots show the white body with red stripes, the red leather interior, the five-spoke wheels and the monogram on the tail. The Ferrari Testarossa whose style it borrows became, for a whole generation, the very image of Miami: its side strakes and oversized proportions did more for how people picture the city than any tourism campaign.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["95-grotti-cheetah-01","95-grotti-cheetah-02","95-grotti-cheetah-03","95-grotti-cheetah-04"],"vuesDeclarees":["face","profil","arriere","interieur"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferrari%20Testarossa","reelNom":"Ferrari Testarossa","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/95-grotti-cheetah-01-480.webp"},{"id":"grotti-itali-gto","nom":"Itali GTO","marque":"Grotti","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Ferrari 812 Superfast","src":"Trailer 1","search":"grotti itali gto ferrari 812 superfast","txt":"The Itali GTO borrows the design language of the Ferrari 812 Superfast: front-mounted V12, compact tail, clustered exhaust tips. The 812 is one of the last Ferraris with a naturally aspirated twelve-cylinder engine, which gives it a special status among collectors today. Whether it comes to Leonida is still to be confirmed.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferrari%20812%20Superfast","reelNom":"Ferrari 812 Superfast","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/grotti-itali-gto.svg"},{"id":"grotti-itali-rsx","nom":"Itali RSX","marque":"Grotti","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Ferrari SF90 Stradale","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The most high-tech Grotti in the lineup, modeled on the Ferrari SF90 Stradale and its plug-in hybrid powertrain. Chopped tail, high-mounted twin exhaust, active aero at the rear. The Extended Look sends it down a clear stretch of highway.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferrari%20SF90%20Stradale","reelNom":"Ferrari SF90 Stradale","search":"grotti itali rsx ferrari sf90 stradale","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/grotti-itali-rsx.svg"},{"id":"invetero-coquette","nom":"Coquette","marque":"Invetero","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Corvette C7, 2014 Corvette Stingray","src":"Trailer 2","search":"invetero coquette corvette c7, 2014 corvette stingray","txt":"Invetero’s Coquette is matched to the Corvette C7, especially the 2014 Corvette Stingray. This inspiration sets this page apart from the other Coquette generations. Our database lists it in Trailer 2, with no name given by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Corvette%20C7","reelNom":"Corvette C7","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/invetero-coquette.svg"},{"id":"invetero-coquette-d10","nom":"Coquette D10","marque":"Invetero","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Corvette C8","src":"Trailer 1","search":"invetero coquette d10 chevrolet corvette c8","txt":"A more hardcore version of the Coquette, in the spirit of the Corvette Z06: wider track, bold aero, sharper engine. The Z06 has traditionally been the version Chevrolet builds for the track while keeping it street-legal. Trailer 1 has it burst into a night shot.","medias":["extended-look-coquette-d10"],"imageAlts":{"extended-look-coquette-d10":"Red convertible in the left foreground, still from An Extended Look"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Corvette%20C8","reelNom":"Chevrolet Corvette C8","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/extended-look-coquette-d10-480.webp"},{"id":"annis-futo","nom":"Futo","marque":"Karin","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Toyota AE86 Levin","src":"Trailer 1","search":"karin futo toyota ae86 levin","txt":"The Futo is the ultimate lightweight rear-wheel-drive car, the one you pick to learn how to drift rather than to go fast. The Toyota AE86, whose shape it borrows, has a huge aura: an affordable, well-balanced car, it became the symbol of amateur drifting before manga culture made it famous. Trailer 1 shows it in the background, taillights on.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20AE86%20Levin","reelNom":"Toyota AE86 Levin","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/annis-futo.svg"},{"id":"karin-sultan","nom":"Sultan","marque":"Karin","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Lexus IS, Mitsubishi Lancer Evo VI, Subaru Impreza","src":"Trailer 1","search":"karin sultan lexus is, mitsubishi lancer evo vi, subaru impreza","txt":"The Sultan is the series’ all-wheel-drive sports sedan, the urban rally car. The Subaru Impreza WRX that inspires it built its reputation on World Rally Championship stages, with its boxer engine and rock-steady handling on broken pavement. Its appearance is logged in Trailer 1; the Sultan name is still a community identification.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lexus%20IS","reelNom":"Lexus IS","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-sultan.svg"},{"id":"karin-sultan-rs","nom":"Sultan RS","marque":"Karin","cat":"sport","st":"comm","insp":"Modified Subaru Impreza WRX STI","txt":"The Sultan pushed into rally spec: fender flares, a spoiler, a hood scoop. It’s the benchmark Japanese all-wheel-drive compact, the one that defined a whole generation of tuning.","search":"karin sultan rs subaru impreza wrx sti preparee","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Subaru%20Impreza%20WRX%20STI","reelNom":"Subaru Impreza WRX STI","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-sultan-rs.svg"},{"id":"maibatsu-penumbra","nom":"Penumbra","marque":"Maibatsu","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Mitsubishi Eclipse, Audi TT","src":"Trailer 2","search":"maibatsu penumbra mitsubishi eclipse, audi tt","txt":"Maibatsu is the series’ mainstream Japanese brand, and the Penumbra is its entry-level sports coupe. It belongs to that class of cars that give you a sports car’s looks without the hardware to match, which makes them very popular starting points for tuning. Trailer 2 puts it in traffic, headlights on.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mitsubishi%20Eclipse","reelNom":"Mitsubishi Eclipse","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/maibatsu-penumbra.svg"},{"id":"maibatsu-penumbra-ff","nom":"Penumbra FF","marque":"Maibatsu","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Mitsubishi Eclipse, second-generation Eagle Talon","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The front-wheel-drive version of the Penumbra, based on the second-generation Mitsubishi Eclipse and its twin, the Eagle Talon. Pop-up headlights, glass hatch: it’s the quintessential ’90s tuner car. The Extended Look catches it in full acceleration.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mitsubishi%20Eclipse","reelNom":"Mitsubishi Eclipse","search":"maibatsu penumbra ff mitsubishi eclipse deuxieme generation, eagle talon deuxieme generation","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/maibatsu-penumbra-ff.svg"},{"id":"mercedes-cle-a236","nom":"CLE-Class Cabriolet","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Mercedes-Benz CLE-Class (A236)","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"Mercedes-Benz’s CLE convertible, the one that replaced both the C-Class and E-Class convertibles in one go. A fabric soft top, four tight seats, and the star planted in the middle of the grille. It shows up in Trailer 2 without having been given an in-game name.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20Classe%20CLE%20(A236)","reelNom":"Mercedes-Benz CLE-Class (A236)","search":"marque inconnue classe cle cabriolet mercedes-benz classe cle (a236)","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/mercedes-cle-a236.svg"},{"id":"cadillac-eldorado-1959","nom":"Eldorado 1959","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Cadillac Eldorado 1959","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"The 1959 Cadillac Eldorado, the one with the oversized tailfins and rocket-shaped taillights, a symbol of America before the fuel crisis. It has been given neither an in-game name nor a fictional maker. Trailer 2 shows it cruising at a crawl along the waterfront.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cadillac%20Eldorado%201959","reelNom":"Cadillac Eldorado 1959","search":"marque inconnue eldorado 1959 cadillac eldorado 1959","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/cadillac-eldorado-1959.svg"},{"id":"kellison-j4","nom":"Kellison J4","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Kellison J4","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A hand-built ’60s fiberglass roadster, made in small numbers by a California coachbuilder for weekend racing. Rockstar hasn’t given it an in-game name. The official screenshots show it parked, hood closed.","medias":["ultimate-edition-02","classic-car-collection-05"],"imageAlts":{"ultimate-edition-02":"Jason and Lucia in front of the green coupe matched to a Kellison J4 in the Ultimate Edition artwork"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Kellison%20J4","reelNom":"Kellison J4","search":"marque inconnue kellison j4 kellison j4","thumb":"/img/officiel/ultimate-edition-02-480.webp"},{"id":"lincoln-mark-viii","nom":"Mark VIII","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Lincoln Mark VIII","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Lincoln’s big personal luxury coupe, the last of the Mark line, with its rounded tail and full-width taillight bar. The in-game name hasn’t been announced. The Extended Look slips it into nighttime traffic, lights on.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Mark%20VIII","reelNom":"Lincoln Mark VIII","search":"marque inconnue mark viii lincoln mark viii","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/lincoln-mark-viii.svg"},{"id":"buick-reatta-convertible","nom":"Reatta Convertible","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Buick Reatta Convertible","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"An American convertible coupe from the late 80s, based on the Buick Reatta: angular lines, soft top, two seats and not one more. Rockstar hasn’t given it an in-game name yet. Trailer 2 shows it parked facing the sea.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Reatta%20Convertible","reelNom":"Buick Reatta Convertible","search":"marque inconnue reatta decapotable buick reatta convertible","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buick-reatta-convertible.svg"},{"id":"obey-8f-drafter","nom":"8F Drafter","marque":"Obey","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"2018 Audi RS5 Coupe","src":"Official screenshots","search":"obey 8f drafter 2018 audi rs5 coupe","txt":"The 8F Drafter is Obey’s four-door coupe, that hybrid category German automakers invented to sell the comfort of a sedan with the lines of a coupe. The name refers to drafting in racing, when a car tucks into the slipstream of another. The official screenshots frame it in profile, with a parking lot in the background.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=2018%20Audi%20RS5%20Coupe","reelNom":"2018 Audi RS5 Coupe","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/obey-8f-drafter.svg"},{"id":"overflod-omnis-e-gt","nom":"Omnis e-GT","marque":"Obey","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Audi e-Tron GT","txt":"An electric grand touring coupe, with no visible exhaust and no engine air intake. Leonida confirms the presence of electric vehicles and charging stations, which gives this category a real role in the game.","search":"obey omnis e-gt audi e-tron gt","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Audi%20e-Tron%20GT","reelNom":"Audi e-Tron GT","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/overflod-omnis-e-gt.svg"},{"id":"ocelot-jugular","nom":"Jugular","marque":"Ocelot","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Jaguar XE SV Project 8","src":"Trailer 1","search":"ocelot jugular jaguar xe sv project 8","txt":"Ocelot is this universe’s Jaguar, and the Jugular is its sports sedan. The Jaguar XE SV Project 8, whose proportions it borrows, is a production sedan pushed to the extreme: fixed wing, widened track and a supercharged V8 made for the racetrack. Trailer 1 has it cross a street shot in just a few frames.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jaguar%20XE%20SV%20Project%208","reelNom":"Jaguar XE SV Project 8","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ocelot-jugular.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-infernus-classic","nom":"Infernus Classic","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Lamborghini Diablo, Cizeta V16T, Ferrari Testarossa","src":"Extended Look","search":"pegassi infernus classic lamborghini diablo, cizeta v16t, ferrari testarossa","txt":"The Infernus is the series’ longtime supercar, around since GTA III. Its Classic version borrows the styling of the Lamborghini Diablo and the Cizeta V16T: sharp angles, scissor doors, almost zero rear visibility. In the ’90s, the Diablo kept alive the look of the supercar on teenagers’ bedroom posters. It’s spotted in the Extended Look.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lamborghini%20Diablo","reelNom":"Lamborghini Diablo","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-infernus-classic.svg"},{"id":"pfister-comet-retro-custom","nom":"Comet Retro Custom","marque":"Pfister","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Rauh-Welt Porsche 911 930","src":"Trailer 1","search":"pfister comet retro custom rauh-welt porsche 911 930","txt":"Pfister is this universe’s Porsche, and the Comet has always been its 911. The Retro Custom version takes its cues from the ’70s and ’80s 911 G-Series, easy to spot thanks to their bellows bumpers. Long looked down on, this generation is now the most sought-after for builds. Trailer 1 shows it widened all around, flared wheel arches included.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Rauh-Welt%20Porsche%20911%20930","reelNom":"Rauh-Welt Porsche 911 930","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pfister-comet-retro-custom.svg"},{"id":"pfister-comet-s2","nom":"Comet S2","marque":"Pfister","cat":"sport","st":"comm","insp":"Porsche 911 992","txt":"Pfister’s coupe in its latest form, based on the 992-generation 911. Engine hanging out behind the rear axle, full-width light bar, wider rear end. The Cabrio version is already in this database.","search":"pfister comet s2 porsche 911 992","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Porsche%20911%20992","reelNom":"Porsche 911 992","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pfister-comet-s2.svg"},{"id":"pfister-comet-s2-cabrio","nom":"Comet S2 Cabrio","marque":"Pfister","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Porsche 911 Turbo S Cabriolet","src":"Trailer 1","search":"pfister comet s2 cabrio porsche 911 turbo s cabriolet","txt":"The convertible version of the modern Comet, modeled on the 992-generation Porsche 911. What makes the open-top 911 special is its layout: with the engine in the back, the body’s stiffness suffers less from losing the roof than on a conventional sports car. Trailer 1 shows it cruising top-down along the waterfront.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-033"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-033":"Turquoise convertible in the left foreground on the seafront, GTA VI Trailer 1 at 00:33"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Porsche%20911%20Turbo%20S%20Cabriolet","reelNom":"Porsche 911 Turbo S Cabriolet","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-033-480.webp"},{"id":"annis-growler","nom":"Growler","marque":"Pfister","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Porsche 718 Cayman","src":"Trailer 2","search":"pfister growler porsche 718 cayman","txt":"The Growler is the Pfister coupe our database matches to the Porsche 718 Cayman. It shows up in Trailer 2. Its identification is still community-based: the official media doesn’t give it a name.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Porsche%20718%20Cayman","reelNom":"Porsche 718 Cayman","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/annis-growler.svg"},{"id":"pfister-neon","nom":"Neon","marque":"Pfister","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"Porsche Taycan, Porsche Panamera, Porsche 918 Spyder","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Pfister’s electric sedan, pieced together from several Porsches: the Taycan for the silhouette, the 918 Spyder for the nose, the Panamera for the roofline. Quiet and heavy, but it can launch really hard. The Extended Look follows it through the city.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Porsche%20Taycan","reelNom":"Porsche Taycan","search":"pfister neon porsche taycan, porsche panamera, porsche 918 spyder","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pfister-neon.svg"},{"id":"ubermacht-cypher","nom":"Cypher","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"BMW M2 F87, with touches of the M6 and M8","src":"Trailer 1","search":"ubermacht cypher bmw m2 f87, avec des touches de m6 et m8","txt":"Übermacht is the series’ BMW, and the Cypher is its sharp compact coupe. The BMW M2 whose styling it borrows belongs to a lineage that goes back to the 80s M3, a street-legal race car that built its reputation on the track before it reached the showrooms. Trailer 1 catches it at a standstill, just before it pulls away.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20M2%20F87","reelNom":"BMW M2 F87","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ubermacht-cypher.svg"},{"id":"ubermacht-sentinel-classic","nom":"Sentinel Classic","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"BMW E30 M3","txt":"The Sentinel has been the BMW of the GTA universe since GTA III. The Classic version takes the silhouette of the E30 from the 80s: flat hood, twin round headlights, slim C-pillar. It’s exactly the kind of German coupe you’d see on Ocean Drive back in the era Vice City brings back to life.","search":"ubermacht sentinel classic bmw e30 m3","src":"Extended Look","medias":["extended-look-sentinel-classic-front","extended-look-sentinel-classic-rear"],"imageAlts":{"extended-look-sentinel-classic-front":"Red convertible in front of some shops, still from An Extended Look","extended-look-sentinel-classic-rear":"Red convertible seen from behind during a driving sequence in An Extended Look"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20E30%20M3","reelNom":"BMW E30 M3","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/extended-look-sentinel-classic-front-480.webp"},{"id":"ubermacht-sentinel-xs","nom":"Sentinel XS","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"BMW M3 E92","txt":"A modern take on the Sentinel, modeled on the 3 Series of the 2000s and 2010s. A rear-wheel-drive compact coupe, integrated bumpers, a sharp shoulder line. The benchmark for the mass-market German sports sedan.","search":"ubermacht sentinel xs bmw m3 e92","src":"Trailer 2","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20M3%20E92","reelNom":"BMW M3 E92","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ubermacht-sentinel-xs.svg"},{"id":"ubermacht-zion","nom":"Zion","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"BMW M6 E63","src":"Official screenshots","search":"ubermacht zion bmw m6 e63","txt":"Übermacht’s well-heeled coupe, the Zion goes for grand touring rather than pure performance: two doors, four seats, an engine that’s enough without being over the top. It’s the car of someone who has made it and doesn’t need to prove it anymore. The official screenshots show it angle-parked, with the roof closed.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20M6%20E63","reelNom":"BMW M6 E63","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ubermacht-zion.svg"},{"id":"ubermacht-zion-cabrio","nom":"Zion Cabrio","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"sport","st":"vu","insp":"BMW 6 Series E64","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The convertible version of the Zion, copied from the BMW 6 Series E64 designed in the Bangle era, controversial rear end included. Four seats, a fabric soft top, a six-cylinder that holds its own. The Extended Look shows it cruising along the coast with the top down.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20S%C3%A9rie%206%20E64","reelNom":"BMW 6 Series E64","search":"ubermacht zion cabrio bmw serie 6 e64","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ubermacht-zion-cabrio.svg"},{"id":"grotti-furia","nom":"Furia","marque":"Grotti","cat":"supercar","st":"vu","insp":"Ferrari 488 Pista and SF90 Stradale","src":"Trailer 1","search":"grotti furia ferrari 488 pista et sf90 stradale","txt":"The Furia is modeled on the Ferrari SF90 Stradale, Ferrari’s first plug-in hybrid road car. The layout is unusual: a turbo V8 in the back and three electric motors, two of them on the front axle, for a total of over a thousand horsepower. It’s a car that can glide along in silence before it transforms. Trailer 1 sends it flying at full speed down an open stretch.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferrari%20488%20Pista","reelNom":"Ferrari 488 Pista","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/grotti-furia.svg"},{"id":"lamborghini-aventador","nom":"Aventador","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"supercar","st":"vu","insp":"Lamborghini Aventador","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"The Lamborghini Aventador as is, scissor doors and naturally aspirated V12, with no in-game name and no fictional maker attached. Rockstar dropped it into the scenery without inventing an in-house equivalent. Trailer 1 shows it in traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lamborghini%20Aventador","reelNom":"Lamborghini Aventador","search":"marque inconnue aventador lamborghini aventador","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/lamborghini-aventador.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-tempesta","nom":"Tempesta","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"supercar","st":"vu","insp":"Lamborghini Huracán and Centenario","src":"Trailer 2","search":"pegassi tempesta lamborghini huracan et centenario","txt":"The Tempesta borrows from the Lamborghini Huracán and the Centenario: a naturally aspirated mid-mounted V10, all-wheel drive, faceted bodywork. The Huracán is one of the last supercars to keep a big naturally aspirated engine, which gives it a sound that turbocharged engines can’t match. Some also see in it the Lotus Esprit designed in 2015 that never went into production.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lamborghini%20Hurac%C3%A1n","reelNom":"Lamborghini Huracán","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-tempesta.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-zentorno","nom":"Zentorno","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"supercar","st":"comm","insp":"Lamborghini Sesto Elemento and Veneno","txt":"A sharp-edged supercar with Y-shaped air intakes and a tapered roof. The Zentorno pushes Lamborghini’s design language to its most extreme form, the one found on limited editions built in just a handful of units.","search":"pegassi zentorno lamborghini sesto elemento et veneno","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lamborghini%20Sesto%20Elemento","reelNom":"Lamborghini Sesto Elemento","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-zentorno.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-zorrusso","nom":"Zorrusso","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"supercar","st":"vu","insp":"Italdesign Zerouno","src":"Trailer 1","search":"pegassi zorrusso italdesign zerouno","txt":"Here, Pegassi’s Zorrusso is linked to the Italdesign Zerouno. This identification is still a community match. Trailer 1 is the appearance on record for this page, with no official name for the vehicle.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Italdesign%20Zerouno","reelNom":"Italdesign Zerouno","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-zorrusso.svg"},{"id":"progen-emerus","nom":"Emerus","marque":"Progen","cat":"supercar","st":"vu","insp":"McLaren Senna","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Progen’s track supercar, traced from the McLaren Senna: a huge wing, scoops everywhere, windows cut all the way down into the lower doors. Everything is sacrificed for downforce, starting with comfort. The Extended Look shows it parked in a garage.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=McLaren%20Senna","reelNom":"McLaren Senna","search":"progen emerus mclaren senna","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/progen-emerus.svg"},{"id":"albany-buccaneer","nom":"Buccaneer","marque":"Albany","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Fairlane, Buick Riviera","src":"Trailer 1","search":"albany buccaneer ford fairlane, buick riviera","txt":"The Buccaneer is the American personal luxury coupe at its most generous. The 1966 Buick Riviera that inspires it is a strikingly designed car, with its hidden headlights and taut C-pillar line, signed by the General Motors design studio at its peak. Trailer 1 shows it coming out of a turn, rear end swinging a little wide.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Fairlane","reelNom":"Ford Fairlane","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-buccaneer.svg"},{"id":"albany-buccaneer-custom","nom":"Buccaneer Custom","marque":"Albany","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Fairlane, Buick Riviera","src":"Trailer 1","search":"albany buccaneer custom ford fairlane, buick riviera","txt":"A tuned version of the Buccaneer, in lowrider style: body slammed to the ground, wire wheels, metal-flake paint. Big ’60s coupes are the historic base of this culture, precisely because their separate frame takes hydraulic suspension well. Trailer 1 catches it under the neon lights of a gas station.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-028"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-028":"Light blue lowrider in the right foreground, GTA VI Trailer 1 at 00:28"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Fairlane","reelNom":"Ford Fairlane","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-028-480.webp"},{"id":"albany-virgo-classic","nom":"Virgo Classic","marque":"Albany","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"Lincoln Continental Mark III","txt":"A 70s personal luxury coupe: simulated spare tire on the trunk, upright grille, vinyl roof. Our database ties this Virgo Classic to Albany and matches it to the Lincoln Continental Mark III.","search":"albany virgo classic lincoln continental mark iii","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Continental%20Mark%20III","reelNom":"Lincoln Continental Mark III","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-virgo-classic.svg"},{"id":"bravado-buffalo-stx","nom":"Buffalo STX","marque":"Bravado","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"2015 Dodge Charger","src":"Trailer 1","search":"bravado buffalo stx 2015 dodge charger","txt":"Sporty version of the Buffalo, with the full kit: front splitter, spoiler, exposed exhausts. It’s the classic American sedan that refuses to be sensible. Trailer 1 lines it up in a parking lot shot, doors closed.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=2015%20Dodge%20Charger","reelNom":"2015 Dodge Charger","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-buffalo-stx.svg"},{"id":"bravado-gauntlet-classic","nom":"Gauntlet Classic","marque":"Bravado","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","src":"Trailer 1","insp":"First-generation Dodge Challenger","txt":"The original Gauntlet, modeled on the first-generation Dodge Challenger: endless hood, pronounced wheel arches, cut-off tail. It’s been Bravado’s go-to muscle car for several games. Trailer 1 shows it driving down a palm-lined avenue.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Challenger","reelNom":"Dodge Challenger","search":"bravado gauntlet classic dodge challenger premiere generation","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-gauntlet-classic.svg"},{"id":"vapid-gauntlet-classic-custom","nom":"Gauntlet Classic Custom","marque":"Bravado","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"Dodge Challenger 1970","src":"Community match","search":"bravado gauntlet classic custom dodge challenger 1970","txt":"A tuned 1970 Dodge Challenger, one of the most sought-after muscle cars today. The 1970 version is the one whose design everyone agrees on, with its quad-headlight grille and straight shoulder line. The Custom suffix means a reworked engine and chassis. Not confirmed by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Challenger%201970","reelNom":"Dodge Challenger 1970","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-gauntlet-classic-custom.svg"},{"id":"bravado-gauntlet-hellfire","nom":"Gauntlet Hellfire","marque":"Bravado","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Challenger Demon 2018","src":"Trailer 1","search":"bravado gauntlet hellfire dodge challenger demon 2018","txt":"The Gauntlet Hellfire borrows the look of the Dodge Challenger SRT Hellcat, a car whose spec sheet is pure provocation: a supercharged V8 with more than seven hundred horsepower in a body designed in 1970, with no pretense of finesse. It became a symbol of America’s refusal to tone things down. Trailer 1 lets it loose on a straightaway, hood shaking.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Challenger%20Demon%202018","reelNom":"Dodge Challenger Demon 2018","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-gauntlet-hellfire.svg"},{"id":"declasse-impaler-lx","nom":"Impaler ’80","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Chevrolet Impala","txt":"The standard Impaler, without the SZ’s body kit. The sixth-generation Chevrolet Impala, the one from the late 1970s, is a huge sedan with a flat roof and straight sides, built by the hundreds of thousands for fleets as much as for families. The official screenshots frame it along a curb.","search":"declasse impaler ’80 chevrolet impala sixieme generation","src":"Official screenshots","medias":["vice-city-09"],"imageAlts":{"vice-city-09":"Blue sedan in the foreground, under the Vice City overpass in GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Impala","reelNom":"Chevrolet Impala","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/vice-city-09-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-impaler-sz","nom":"Impaler SZ","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"1994-1996 Chevrolet Impala SS","src":"Official screenshots","search":"declasse impaler sz 1994-1996 chevrolet impala ss","txt":"Declasse is the series’ Chevrolet, and the Impaler is its big mainstream sedan. The SZ is its sporty version, in the spirit of street builds. The name plays on the Impala, a model that’s everywhere in American car culture. In our database, this Impaler SZ is linked to the official screenshots; its name is still a community identification.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Impala%20SS","reelNom":"Chevrolet Impala SS","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-impaler-sz.svg"},{"id":"declasse-sabre-turbo","nom":"Sabre Turbo","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Chevelle, Oldsmobile Cutlass","src":"Trailer 1","search":"declasse sabre turbo chevrolet chevelle, oldsmobile cutlass","txt":"The Sabre Turbo blends the Chevrolet Chevelle and the Oldsmobile Cutlass, two General Motors midsize cars that shared the same platform in the early 70s. It was the golden age of big V8s, brutally cut short by the 1973 oil crisis. As for the Turbo suffix, it’s a tuning thing: these engines never had forced induction from the factory.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Chevelle","reelNom":"Chevrolet Chevelle","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-sabre-turbo.svg"},{"id":"declasse-tulip","nom":"Tulip","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"1972 Chevelle Malibu, 1972 Oldsmobile Cutlass Supreme","src":"Trailer 1","search":"declasse tulip 1972 chevelle malibu, 1972 oldsmobile cutlass supreme","txt":"The Tulip takes after the 1972 Chevelle Malibu and Oldsmobile Cutlass Supreme, the last model year before emissions rules came along and choked American engines. These midsize cars sold by the millions, which is why you still see them everywhere, often in rough shape. It’s a neighborhood car, not a collector’s car.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-071"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-071":"Red sedan driven by Jason with Lucia, seen from the side in GTA VI Trailer 1 around 01:11"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=1972%20Chevelle%20Malibu","reelNom":"1972 Chevelle Malibu","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-071-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-tulip-m100","nom":"Tulip M100","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Chevrolet Malibu","src":"Trailer 1","search":"declasse tulip m100 chevrolet malibu quatrieme generation","txt":"A tuned version of the Tulip, in the spirit of neighborhood muscle cars: swapped engine, reworked suspension, and a look that doesn’t apologize. The M100 suffix nods to the chassis codes tuners use to name their base cars. Trailer 1 has it parked by a suburban house.","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-028"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-028":"Lifted pink sedan in the center, GTA VI Trailer 1 at 00:28"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Malibu","reelNom":"Chevrolet Malibu","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-028-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-vigero-zx-convertible","nom":"Vigero ZX Convertible","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Chevrolet Camaro","src":"Official screenshots","search":"declasse vigero zx convertible chevrolet camaro sixieme generation","txt":"The open-top version of the modern Vigero, modeled on the current Chevrolet Camaro. Today’s Camaro deliberately copies the proportions of the 1969 generation, with a high beltline that cuts visibility a lot, a trade-off made on purpose for the sake of style. The official screenshots show it with the top down, under a clear sky.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Camaro","reelNom":"Chevrolet Camaro","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-vigero-zx-convertible.svg"},{"id":"declasse-voodoo","nom":"Voodoo","marque":"Declasse","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"Chevrolet Impala 1960","txt":"The classic Grand Theft Auto lowrider, around since San Andreas. Slammed body, hydraulic suspension, metallic paint. It fits right in with a hot city and a backdrop of wide boulevards.","search":"declasse voodoo chevrolet impala 1960","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Impala%201960","reelNom":"Chevrolet Impala 1960","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-voodoo.svg"},{"id":"imponte-phoenix","nom":"Phoenix","marque":"Imponte","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Pontiac Firebird","src":"Trailer 2","search":"imponte phoenix pontiac firebird deuxieme generation","txt":"Imponte is the GTA universe’s Pontiac, a brand that no longer exists in real life but still holds a central place in American car culture. The Phoenix borrows the cues of the ’70s Firebird, with its huge hood and bird decal. Trailer 2 frames it from a low angle, rear spoiler included.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Pontiac%20Firebird","reelNom":"Pontiac Firebird","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/imponte-phoenix.svg"},{"id":"imponte-ruiner","nom":"Ruiner","marque":"Imponte","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Pontiac Trans Am/Chevrolet Camaro","src":"Trailer 1","search":"imponte ruiner pontiac trans am/chevrolet camaro","txt":"The Ruiner is the series’ Pontiac Trans Am, a car you can’t separate from ’70s and ’80s American pop culture, made famous by movies and TV. Its silhouette, scoops and hood stripes did more for its reputation than its actual performance. Trailer 1 sends it speeding through an intersection.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Pontiac%20Trans%20Am%2FChevrolet%20Camaro","reelNom":"Pontiac Trans Am/Chevrolet Camaro","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/imponte-ruiner.svg"},{"id":"sirius","nom":"Sirius","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"1970 Mercury Cougar","src":"Ultimate Edition","note":"The Sirius name is readable on the rear fender of the turquoise muscle car in the Wyman collection.","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"marque inconnue sirius 1970 mercury cougar","txt":"The official screenshots show a turquoise muscle car with gold stripes, a trunk spoiler and three-spoke wheels, with the Sirius name spelled out on the rear fender. Neither our previous list nor the ones on other sites mentioned this model: it’s a find that comes straight from Rockstar’s material. The silhouette is that of a 1970 Mercury Cougar, the Mustang’s pricier cousin. The manufacturer hasn’t been announced.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["classic-car-collection-02"],"vuesDeclarees":["profil"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=1970%20Mercury%20Cougar","reelNom":"1970 Mercury Cougar","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/classic-car-collection-02-480.webp"},{"id":"schyster-deviant","nom":"Deviant","marque":"Schyster","cat":"muscle","st":"officiel","insp":"1972 AMC Javelin","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"schyster deviant 1972 amc javelin","txt":"The Deviant’s name comes from Rockstar, through the Ultimate Edition reveal, and our official screenshot shows it decked out in the colors of the American flag, with the cursive monogram on the rear pillar and the interior visible through the window. The AMC Javelin whose proportions it borrows was the market’s underdog: built by an independent automaker much smaller than Detroit’s Big Three, it still won the Trans-Am championship against the Mustangs and Camaros.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["classic-car-collection-06"],"vuesDeclarees":["profil"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=1972%20AMC%20Javelin","reelNom":"1972 AMC Javelin","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/classic-car-collection-06-480.webp"},{"id":"vapid-chino","nom":"Chino","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"1965 Lincoln Continental and Chrysler Imperial","src":"Trailer 1","search":"vapid chino lincoln continental et chrysler imperial de 1965","txt":"The Chino is the secondhand American coupe, the one you buy for next to nothing and keep for twenty years. In the series, it’s tied to working-class neighborhoods and lowrider culture. Its appeal is less about what it can do than about what it stands for. Its presence here is based on what players have spotted.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Continental","reelNom":"Lincoln Continental","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-chino.svg"},{"id":"vapid-chino-custom","nom":"Chino Custom","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"Lincoln Continental Mark IV and V, built as a lowrider","src":"Community match","search":"vapid chino custom lincoln continental mark iv et v, prepare en lowrider","txt":"A tuned-up version of the Chino: hydraulic suspension, wire wheels, multi-coat paint job. In Vice City, this look isn’t just decoration but a sign of belonging, handed down from Miami’s Cuban and Puerto Rican communities. Model not confirmed by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Continental%20Mark%20IV","reelNom":"Lincoln Continental Mark IV","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-chino-custom.svg"},{"id":"vapid-dominator","nom":"Dominator","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Mustang","src":"Trailer 1","search":"vapid dominator ford mustang","txt":"The Dominator is the series’ Ford Mustang, and Vapid is its Ford. The modern Mustang carries on a line that started in 1964, with one constant: a big front engine, rear-wheel drive, and a price kept affordable on purpose. It was spotted in Trailer 1, with no name announced by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang","reelNom":"Ford Mustang","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-dominator.svg"},{"id":"vapid-dominator-67","nom":"Dominator ’67","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","src":"Official screenshots","insp":"First-generation Ford Mustang","txt":"The Dominator in its original form, that of the first-generation Ford Mustang: wide grille, sculpted sides, short tail. It’s the ancestor of the whole line, in road trim rather than as a lifted buggy. The official screenshots place it in a private collection.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang","reelNom":"Ford Mustang","search":"vapid dominator ’67 ford mustang premiere generation","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-dominator-67.svg"},{"id":"vapid-dominator-asp","nom":"Dominator ASP","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Mustang SVT Cobra R (New Edge)","src":"Trailer 1","search":"vapid dominator asp ford mustang svt cobra r (new edge)","txt":"A tuned variant of the Dominator, with aero add-ons and a wider track. Ford has always spun the Mustang off into more and more extreme versions, all the way to models that are barely street-legal. Trailer 1 shows it glued to another car’s bumper.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang%20SVT%20Cobra%20R%20(New%20Edge)","reelNom":"Ford Mustang SVT Cobra R (New Edge)","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-dominator-asp.svg"},{"id":"vapid-dominator-buggy","nom":"Dominator Buggy ’67","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"officiel","insp":"1967 Ford Mustang, built for off-road","src":"Official Ultimate Edition page","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"vapid dominator buggy ’67 ford mustang de 1967, preparee tout-terrain","txt":"Rockstar named this vehicle in the Ultimate Edition reveal, and our four official screenshots show it from every angle: blue body with a yellow stripe, number 6, tractor tires, a roof bar with four spotlights, a mesh grille behind a bull bar. The interior keeps the original three-spoke steering wheel and speedometer. A 1967 Ford Mustang, lifted and built for mud: on its own, it sums up rural swamp Florida, a few miles from the towers of Vice City.","medias":["67-vapid-dominator-buggy-01","67-vapid-dominator-buggy-02","67-vapid-dominator-buggy-03","67-vapid-dominator-buggy-04"],"edition":"Ultimate Edition","vuesDeclarees":["face","profil","interieur","detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang%20de%201967","reelNom":"1967 Ford Mustang","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/67-vapid-dominator-buggy-01-480.webp"},{"id":"vapid-dominator-gt","nom":"Dominator GT","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"2018-2023 Ford Mustang Convertible","src":"Official screenshots","search":"vapid dominator gt 2018-2023 ford mustang convertible","txt":"The convertible version of the Dominator. The drop-top Mustang has existed since the very first generation and makes up a big share of sales in Florida, where the weather makes a roof almost pointless. The official screenshots park it in front of a beachfront villa.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang%20Convertible","reelNom":"Ford Mustang Convertible","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-dominator-gt.svg"},{"id":"vapid-dominator-gtx","nom":"Dominator GTX","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Modern Ford Mustang and Dodge Charger","src":"Trailer 1","search":"vapid dominator gtx ford mustang et dodge charger contemporaines","txt":"Another variant of the Dominator, in the vein of the special editions Ford keeps piling onto the Mustang: commemorative liveries, reworked engines, limited numbered runs. The Dominator GTX was spotted in Trailer 1 and goes by a name suggested by the community.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Mustang","reelNom":"Ford Mustang","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-dominator-gtx.svg"},{"id":"vapid-slamvan","nom":"Slamvan","marque":"Vapid","cat":"muscle","st":"vu","insp":"Ford F-Series 1953-1956 built as a rat rod","src":"Trailer 1","search":"vapid slamvan ford f-series 1953-1956 prepare rat rod","txt":"The Slamvan is a pickup slammed to the ground, somewhere between a custom build and a show vehicle. Lowering trucks is a California and Texas tradition, born in the ’80s around Japanese mini-trucks. The version listed here is tied to Trailer 1, with no official name announced.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-Series%20pr%C3%A9par%C3%A9%20rat%20rod","reelNom":"Ford F-Series built as a rat rod","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-slamvan.svg"},{"id":"willard-faction","nom":"Faction","marque":"Willard","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"80s Buick Regal","txt":"A late-80s American two-door coupe, the series’ classic lowrider base. Straight lines, thick C-pillar, thin grille.","search":"willard faction buick regal des annees 80","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Regal%20des%20ann%C3%A9es%2080","reelNom":"80s Buick Regal","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/willard-faction.svg"},{"id":"willard-faction-custom-donk","nom":"Faction Custom Donk","marque":"Willard","cat":"muscle","st":"comm","insp":"Buick Regal in donk configuration","txt":"The donk is a customization style born in the American South, especially in Miami: raised body, huge-diameter rims, loud paint. It’s one of the few car styles truly rooted in the region Leonida represents.","search":"willard faction custom donk buick regal en configuration donk","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Buick%20Regal%20en%20configuration%20donk","reelNom":"Buick Regal in donk configuration","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/willard-faction-custom-donk.svg"},{"id":"albany-cavalcade-xl","nom":"Cavalcade XL","marque":"Albany","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Cadillac Escalade-V 2023","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The American luxury SUV at its showiest. The Escalade-V whose looks it borrows packs a supercharged six-liter V8 into a two-and-a-half-ton body. It’s the ultimate status vehicle, the one you see in motorcades and music videos.","search":"albany cavalcade xl cadillac escalade-v 2023","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cadillac%20Escalade-V%202023","reelNom":"Cadillac Escalade-V 2023","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/albany-cavalcade-xl.svg"},{"id":"benefactor-dubsta","nom":"Dubsta","marque":"Benefactor","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Mercedes-Benz G-Class","src":"Trailer 1","search":"benefactor dubsta mercedes-benz g-class","txt":"The Dubsta borrows the styling of the Mercedes-Benz G-Class, a vehicle first designed for the army that stayed in production almost unchanged for forty years. Its success comes from a paradox: a military machine turned urban luxury item, sold for a fortune in neighborhoods where it will never have to clear a single obstacle. Trailer 1 has it up on a sidewalk, bumper first.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20G-Class","reelNom":"Mercedes-Benz G-Class","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/benefactor-dubsta.svg"},{"id":"benefactor-xls","nom":"XLS","marque":"Benefactor","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Mercedes-Benz GL-Class","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A large three-row German SUV, somewhere between the Mercedes GL and the BMW X5. Spotted in the Extended Look. It’s the executive SUV format: long enough for seven seats and plush enough to never leave the pavement.","search":"benefactor xls mercedes-benz classe gl","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20Classe%20GL","reelNom":"Mercedes-Benz GL-Class","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/benefactor-xls.svg"},{"id":"bravado-dorado","nom":"Dorado","marque":"Bravado","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"First-generation Dodge Durango","src":"Official screenshots","search":"bravado dorado dodge durango premiere generation","txt":"The Dorado is modeled on the first-generation Dodge Durango, released in 1998 on a Dakota pickup base. It was Chrysler’s answer to the American market’s shift toward the family SUV: three rows of seats, towing capacity, and gas mileage nobody was paying attention to yet.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Durango","reelNom":"Dodge Durango","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-dorado.svg"},{"id":"enus-jubilee","nom":"Jubilee","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Rolls-Royce Cullinan","src":"Trailer 1","search":"buckingham jubilee rolls-royce cullinan","txt":"The Jubilee is the lineup’s ultra-luxury SUV, modeled on the Rolls-Royce Cullinan. Its arrival in the real world was a turning point: a brand that had always refused to build off-roaders got into them because they became its main source of profit. Coach doors, an upright grille, an unapologetic ride height.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Rolls-Royce%20Cullinan","reelNom":"Rolls-Royce Cullinan","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/enus-jubilee.svg"},{"id":"canis-mesa","nom":"Mesa","marque":"Canis","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Jeep Wrangler","src":"Official Ultimate Edition artwork","note":"The Canis badge is readable on the grille of the green pickup shown in the One-Eyed Willie workshop.","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"canis mesa jeep wrangler","txt":"The official screenshots we collected show this bright green four-door pickup in the One-Eyed Willie garage, with the Canis badge spelled out in full on the grille, a winch, tow hooks and a skid plate under the engine. A garage shot shows it with the hood open, in the middle of a build. The silhouette recalls Jeep-style ladder-frame off-roaders. Rockstar hasn’t named the model.","vuesDeclarees":["face","profil","detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jeep%20Wrangler","reelNom":"Jeep Wrangler","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/canis-mesa.svg"},{"id":"declasse-seminole-frontier","nom":"Seminole Frontier","marque":"Canis","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Jeep Cherokee XJ","txt":"A compact SUV with a boxy body, flat wheel arches and a vertical C-pillar. The name refers to the Seminole people of Florida, whose historical territory covers part of what the game calls Leonida.","search":"canis seminole frontier jeep cherokee xj deuxieme generation","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jeep%20Cherokee%20XJ","reelNom":"Jeep Cherokee XJ","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-seminole-frontier.svg"},{"id":"canis-terminus","nom":"Terminus","marque":"Canis","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Jeep Wrangler Rubicon","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A short off-roader with exposed roll bars, modeled on the current Wrangler Rubicon. The Wrangler is still one of the few mainstream 4x4s to keep solid axles and a removable roof, which explains why you see it all over Florida’s wetlands. Seen in the Extended Look.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jeep%20Wrangler%20Rubicon","reelNom":"Jeep Wrangler Rubicon","search":"canis terminus jeep wrangler rubicon quatrieme generation","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/canis-terminus.svg"},{"id":"declasse-granger","nom":"Granger","marque":"Declasse","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Suburban","src":"Trailer 2","search":"declasse granger chevrolet suburban","txt":"The Granger is the big body-on-frame American SUV, modeled on the Chevrolet Suburban. This kind of vehicle holds a special place in the United States: family car, service vehicle and law enforcement cruiser, all at once. It appears in Trailer 2.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Suburban","reelNom":"Chevrolet Suburban","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-granger.svg"},{"id":"declasse-granger-3600lx","nom":"Granger 3600LX","marque":"Declasse","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Suburban 2015-2020","src":"Trailer 1","search":"declasse granger 3600lx chevrolet suburban 2015-2020","txt":"The high-end version of the Granger, in the spirit of the luxury trims General Motors piles onto its big SUVs: leather, chrome, twenty-two-inch wheels. The vehicle can be seen in Trailer 1.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Suburban","reelNom":"Chevrolet Suburban","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-granger-3600lx.svg"},{"id":"dundreary-landstalker-xl","nom":"Landstalker XL","marque":"Dundreary","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Lincoln Navigator","src":"Trailer 2","search":"dundreary landstalker xl lincoln navigator quatrieme generation","txt":"The Landstalker XL takes after the fourth-generation Lincoln Navigator, the big American luxury SUV in its most imposing form. Lincoln took the living-room-on-wheels idea all the way: three rows, leather trim, panoramic screen. It’s the ride of Vice City’s rich neighborhoods, the one you park in front of the hotel without getting out.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Navigator","reelNom":"Lincoln Navigator","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/dundreary-landstalker-xl.svg"},{"id":"gallivanter-baller","nom":"Baller II","marque":"Gallivanter","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Range Rover Evoque and Range Rover Sport","src":"Official screenshots","search":"gallivanter baller ii range rover evoque et range rover sport","txt":"Gallivanter is the Land Rover of the GTA universe, and the Baller is its city version, based on the Range Rover Sport. The real model shows a telling shift: it started out as a British farm utility vehicle and became the go-to ride in wealthy neighborhoods, with off-road abilities nobody ever uses.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Range%20Rover%20Evoque","reelNom":"Range Rover Evoque","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/gallivanter-baller.svg"},{"id":"gallivanter-baller-st","nom":"Baller ST-D","marque":"Gallivanter","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Range Rover L460","txt":"The performance version of the Baller: redesigned bumper, quad exhaust tips, big-diameter wheels. The fast luxury SUV is an archetype that feels right at home in Vice City’s wealthy neighborhoods.","search":"gallivanter baller st-d range rover l460","src":"Official screenshots","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Range%20Rover%20L460","reelNom":"Range Rover L460","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/gallivanter-baller-st.svg"},{"id":"vapid-contender","nom":"Contender","marque":"Karin","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Ford F-150 Raptor and modified Toyota Tundra","src":"Official screenshots","search":"karin contender ford f-150 raptor et toyota tundra prepare","txt":"A full-size pickup based on the tuned Toyota Tundra, with touches of the Ford F-150 Raptor: the lifted recreational truck kind, built for trails more than for the city. The official screenshots show it perched on its knobby tires.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-150%20Raptor","reelNom":"Ford F-150 Raptor","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-contender.svg"},{"id":"karin-vivanite","nom":"Vivanite","marque":"Karin","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Toyota Sienna","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A Japanese minivan spotted in the Extended Look. The Sienna it borrows its lines from made hybrid power standard, a rare choice in this segment. Since Karin is the GTA universe’s Toyota, the family tie is clear.","search":"karin vivanite toyota sienna quatrieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20Sienna","reelNom":"Toyota Sienna","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/karin-vivanite.svg"},{"id":"lampadati-novak","nom":"Novak","marque":"Lampadati","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Maserati Levante","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"An Italian luxury SUV, somewhere between the Maserati Levante and the Alfa Romeo Stelvio. Lampadati covers both brands in the GTA universe. The challenge is fitting a sports sedan’s character into a raised body, with debatable results.","search":"lampadati novak maserati levante","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Maserati%20Levante","reelNom":"Maserati Levante","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/lampadati-novak.svg"},{"id":"mammoth-patriot-mil-spec","nom":"Patriot Mil-Spec","marque":"Mammoth","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Hummer H1","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A military version of the Patriot, modeled on the civilian Hummer H1, itself derived from the US Army’s Humvee. Wide, slow and thirsty, it never had any selling point other than its go-anywhere ability and its looks. Spotted in the Extended Look.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Hummer%20H1","reelNom":"Hummer H1","search":"mammoth patriot mil-spec hummer h1","thumb":"/img/schemas/mammoth-patriot-mil-spec.svg"},{"id":"dodge-durango-3","nom":"Durango","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Third-generation Dodge Durango","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"A third-generation American family SUV, offered with engines that are anything but family-friendly in its most powerful versions. Not to be confused with the Dorado, which is based on the first generation. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue durango dodge durango troisieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Durango","reelNom":"Dodge Durango","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/dodge-durango-3.svg"},{"id":"ford-explorer-2","nom":"Explorer ’95","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Ford Explorer","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"The SUV that tipped the American market. The second-generation Explorer, sold by the millions in the 90s, convinced families to give up the station wagon. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue explorer ’95 ford explorer deuxieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Explorer","reelNom":"Ford Explorer","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-explorer-2.svg"},{"id":"audi-q7-2","nom":"Q7","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Audi Q7","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A large three-row German SUV, second generation. The Audi Q7 launched a lineup for the brand that today makes up most of its sales, at the expense of the sedans that built its reputation. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue q7 audi q7 deuxieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Audi%20Q7","reelNom":"Audi Q7","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/audi-q7-2.svg"},{"id":"toyota-rav4-5","nom":"RAV4","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fifth-generation Toyota RAV4","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"A Japanese compact SUV, and for several years now the best-selling vehicle in the world, all categories combined. Seeing it in Leonida’s traffic is just statistical realism. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue rav4 toyota rav4 cinquieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20RAV4","reelNom":"Toyota RAV4","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/toyota-rav4-5.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-toros","nom":"Toros","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Lamborghini Urus and Audi Q8","src":"Official screenshots","search":"pegassi toros lamborghini urus et audi q8","txt":"The Toros takes the Lamborghini Urus approach: an SUV built on a mass-production base, dressed in the brand’s styling and fitted with an extreme engine. Commercially, it’s the model that let Lamborghini double its production. It shows up in the official screenshots.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lamborghini%20Urus","reelNom":"Lamborghini Urus","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-toros.svg"},{"id":"pfister-astron","nom":"Astron","marque":"Pfister","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Porsche Macan","src":"Trailer 2","search":"pfister astron porsche macan","txt":"The Astron is Pfister’s SUV, modeled on the Porsche Macan, the Cayenne’s little brother. When it launched in 2002, the Cayenne caused an outcry among the brand’s purists, before becoming the model that paid to keep the sports cars in the lineup. Rockstar let it show up in Trailer 2.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Porsche%20Macan","reelNom":"Porsche Macan","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pfister-astron.svg"},{"id":"ubermacht-rebla-gts","nom":"Rebla GTS","marque":"Übermacht","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation BMW X5","txt":"A German coupe SUV, with a sloping roofline and a raked tailgate. The Rebla fills the niche of the SUV that tries to look like a sports sedan, a niche invented by none other than the model that inspired it.","search":"ubermacht rebla gts bmw x5 quatrieme generation","src":"Extended Look","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMW%20X5","reelNom":"BMW X5","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/ubermacht-rebla-gts.svg"},{"id":"vapid-aleutian","nom":"Aleutian","marque":"Vapid","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Ford Expedition","src":"Trailer 2","search":"vapid aleutian ford expedition quatrieme generation","txt":"A big American SUV with three rows of seats, the Aleutian belongs to the class of vehicles built to carry seven people and their luggage on long highway trips. Trailer 2 puts it in a residential driveway, tailgate up.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Expedition","reelNom":"Ford Expedition","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-aleutian.svg"},{"id":"vapid-montagne","nom":"Montagne","marque":"Vapid","cat":"suv","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Ford Explorer","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"The modern Explorer, back to rear-wheel drive after twenty years of front-wheel drive. Since Vapid is the Ford brand of this universe, the link is direct. It’s the most common American police SUV today, and it also shows up in civilian trim.","search":"vapid montagne ford explorer sixieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Explorer","reelNom":"Ford Explorer","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-montagne.svg"},{"id":"vapid-riata-classic","nom":"Riata Classic","marque":"Vapid","cat":"suv","st":"officiel","insp":"First-generation Ford Bronco","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"vapid riata classic ford bronco premiere generation","txt":"Rockstar is the one naming the Riata Classic, in passing with the Ultimate Edition, and our official screenshot shows its profile: cream body, red-and-yellow gradient side stripes, off-road tires, a script monogram on the fender. The first-generation Ford Bronco whose look it borrows was a simple utility vehicle, barely more than a chassis and a body, and has since become a sought-after collector’s item.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["classic-car-collection-03"],"vuesDeclarees":["profil"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Bronco","reelNom":"Ford Bronco","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/classic-car-collection-03-480.webp"},{"id":"annis-hellion","nom":"Hellion","marque":"Annis","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Nissan Patrol Safari Y6, Jeep Cherokee (XJ)","src":"Trailer 1","search":"annis hellion nissan patrol safari y6, jeep cherokee (xj)","txt":"The Hellion is the Annis off-roader, which is unusual for a brand linked to Japanese sports cars. Its compact, boxy shape recalls 80s Japanese 4x4s, built for rough terrain rather than comfort. It shows up on screen in Trailer 1.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Nissan%20Patrol%20Safari%20Y6","reelNom":"Nissan Patrol Safari Y6","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/annis-hellion.svg"},{"id":"bravado-bison-900-95-monster-truck","nom":"Bison 900 ’95 Monster Truck","marque":"Bravado","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Dodge Ram in monster truck configuration","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The Bison 900 ’95 on raised axles and tractor tires. The monster truck was born in the southern United States in the late 70s, when pickup owners kept going up in wheel size until it turned into a show. Florida has several tracks for it.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Ram%20en%20configuration%20monster%20truck","reelNom":"Dodge Ram in monster truck configuration","search":"bravado bison 900 ’95 monster truck dodge ram deuxieme generation en configuration monster truck","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-bison-900-95-monster-truck.svg"},{"id":"canis-kamacho","nom":"Kamacho","marque":"Canis","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Jeep Crew Chief 715 concept","txt":"An off-roader with a cut-down body and knobby tires, built for off-roading. Leonida’s swamps and backcountry trails give it a real use rather than a decorative one.","search":"canis kamacho jeep crew chief 715 concept","src":"Official screenshots","medias":["one-eyed-willie-s-mod-shop-01","ultimate-edition-one-eyed-willie-03"],"imageAlts":{"one-eyed-willie-s-mod-shop-01":"Green Canis pickup built at One-Eyed Willie’s in GTA VI.","ultimate-edition-one-eyed-willie-03":"Green Canis pickup at One-Eyed Willie’s in GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jeep%20Crew%20Chief%20715%20concept","reelNom":"Jeep Crew Chief 715 concept","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/one-eyed-willie-s-mod-shop-01-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-rancher","nom":"Rancher","marque":"Declasse","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Suburban","src":"Official screenshots","search":"declasse rancher chevrolet suburban","txt":"The Rancher is an old-generation utility off-roader, closer to farm equipment than to a leisure vehicle. In the series, it’s tied to rural areas, which fits the swamps and farms of northern Leonida. It appears in the screenshots released by Rockstar.","medias":["trailer-2-rancher-035"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-rancher-035":"Red and white pickup with two passengers in the bed, in front of Jason’s car on the expressway, GTA VI Trailer 2 around 00:35."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Suburban","reelNom":"Chevrolet Suburban","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-rancher-035-480.webp"},{"id":"declasse-walton-l35-stock","nom":"Walton L35","marque":"Declasse","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet S-10 1991-1993","src":"Official screenshots","search":"declasse walton l35 chevrolet s-10 1991-1993","txt":"A small old-school work pickup, with a single cab and a short bed. The early-90s Chevrolet S-10 was the cheapest compact work truck on the US market, sold to tradespeople and farms. Its value has been climbing again since the segment disappeared from automakers’ lineups.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20S-10","reelNom":"Chevrolet S-10","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-walton-l35-stock.svg"},{"id":"declasse-yosemite","nom":"Yosemite","marque":"Declasse","cat":"pickup","st":"comm","insp":"60s Chevrolet C10","txt":"A classic single-cab American pickup, often restored as a collector’s vehicle. The 1500 variant is already in this database.","search":"declasse yosemite chevrolet c10 des annees 60","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20C10%20des%20ann%C3%A9es%2060","reelNom":"60s Chevrolet C10","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-yosemite.svg"},{"id":"declasse-yosemite-1500","nom":"Yosemite 1500","marque":"Declasse","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"First-generation Chevrolet Silverado","src":"Official screenshots","search":"declasse yosemite 1500 chevrolet silverado premiere generation","txt":"The Yosemite 1500 follows the first-generation Chevrolet Silverado, launched in 1999 to replace the C/K. It’s the pickup that tipped the category toward sedan-like comfort: extended cab, four doors, chrome trim. It shows up in the official screenshots.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Silverado","reelNom":"Chevrolet Silverado","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-yosemite-1500.svg"},{"id":"dinka-verus","nom":"Verus","marque":"Dinka","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Polaris Sportsman MV850","txt":"An off-road quad with a tube frame and wide tires. The vehicle for sandy trails and places no car can get through.","search":"dinka verus polaris sportsman mv850","src":"Official screenshots","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Polaris%20Sportsman%20MV850","reelNom":"Polaris Sportsman MV850","thumb":"/img/schemas/dinka-verus.svg"},{"id":"bravado-rebel","nom":"Rebel","marque":"Karin","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Toyota Hilux","src":"Official screenshots","search":"karin rebel toyota hilux","txt":"The Rebel is modeled on the Toyota Hilux, a pickup so famous for being indestructible that it became the go-to vehicle for conflict zones and expeditions. Its mechanical simplicity is exactly what makes it valuable. It shows up in the official screenshots.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Toyota%20Hilux","reelNom":"Toyota Hilux","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-rebel.svg"},{"id":"dodge-dakota-convertible","nom":"Dakota Convertible","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Dakota Convertible","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"An automotive oddity: a convertible pickup, built by Dodge in just a few thousand units in the late 80s. The idea never caught on, which makes it an unlikely collector’s item today. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue dakota decapotable dodge dakota convertible","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Dakota%20Convertible","reelNom":"Dodge Dakota Convertible","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/dodge-dakota-convertible.svg"},{"id":"ford-explorer-sport-trac","nom":"Explorer Sport Trac","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","src":"Extended Look","insp":"Ford Explorer Sport Trac","txt":"The Ford Explorer Sport Trac, that short-bed SUV stuck halfway between a station wagon and a pickup, in its civilian version. It’s the same chassis as the one in lifeguard livery, with a stock body. The Extended Look leaves it parked in a beachside lot.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Explorer%20Sport%20Trac","reelNom":"Ford Explorer Sport Trac","search":"marque inconnue explorer sport trac ford explorer sport trac","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-explorer-sport-trac.svg"},{"id":"ford-f-series-3","nom":"F-Series ’50","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Third-generation Ford F-Series","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A Ford pickup from the 50s, third generation, the one with wide grilles and rounded fenders. It’s the shape people associate with the farms and gas stations of that era, and a base custom builders really go after. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue f-series ’50 ford f-series troisieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-Series","reelNom":"Ford F-Series","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-f-series-3.svg"},{"id":"ram-3500","nom":"RAM 3500","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"RAM 3500","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A heavy-duty pickup with dual rear wheels, built to tow loads that nothing else can. It’s the go-to truck for hauling horses, boats and travel trailers. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue ram 3500 ram 3500","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=RAM%203500","reelNom":"RAM 3500","thumb":"/img/schemas/ram-3500.svg"},{"id":"jeep-scrambler-cj8","nom":"Scrambler CJ-8","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Jeep Scrambler CJ-8","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A long-wheelbase Jeep CJ with a small bed in the back, built from 1981 to 1986. It sold poorly back then, but it has become a cult classic among off-road fans. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue scrambler cj-8 jeep scrambler cj-8","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Jeep%20Scrambler%20CJ-8","reelNom":"Jeep Scrambler CJ-8","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/jeep-scrambler-cj8.svg"},{"id":"swamp-buggy","nom":"Swamp Buggy","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Palm Beach swamp buggy","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A marsh machine riding on oversized wheels, a South Florida specialty. Swamp buggies have been raced there since the 40s, in muddy pits rather than on a track. Sighted in Trailer 1. Its in-game name hasn’t been announced.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Swamp%20buggy%20de%20Palm%20Beach","reelNom":"Palm Beach swamp buggy","search":"marque inconnue swamp buggy swamp buggy de palm beach","thumb":"/img/schemas/swamp-buggy.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-blazer","nom":"Blazer","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Yamaha YFZ450","src":"Trailer 1","search":"nagasaki blazer yamaha yfz450","txt":"The Blazer is a recreational quad, a four-wheeler with handlebars built for sand and trails. Florida, with its beaches and forest trails, is one of the busiest markets for this kind of machine. The quad crosses several shots of Trailer 1.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Yamaha%20YFZ450","reelNom":"Yamaha YFZ450","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-blazer.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-outlaw","nom":"Outlaw","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Can-Am Maverick X3 Turbo","src":"Trailer 1","search":"nagasaki outlaw can-am maverick x3 turbo","txt":"A tube-frame off-road buggy, the Outlaw sits somewhere between a quad and a car: full roll cage, two seats side by side, long-travel suspension. The buggy appears in Trailer 1.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Can-Am%20Maverick%20X3%20Turbo","reelNom":"Can-Am Maverick X3 Turbo","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-outlaw.svg"},{"id":"vapid-caracara","nom":"Caracara","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Ford F-150, Hennessey VelociRaptor 6X6","txt":"The base version of the Caracara, before the beefed-up 4x4 variant. A compact short-cab pickup, made more for dirt trails than for the highway.","search":"vapid caracara ford f-150, hennessey velociraptor 6x6","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-150","reelNom":"Ford F-150","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-caracara.svg"},{"id":"vapid-caracara-4x4","nom":"Caracara 4x4","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Ford F-150 Raptor","src":"Trailer 2","search":"vapid caracara 4x4 ford f-150 raptor deuxieme generation","txt":"The Caracara 4x4 brings the Ford F-150 Raptor into the game, a pickup built to go fast on dirt tracks rather than crawl slowly over obstacles. Its long-travel suspension comes straight from Baja desert racing. It appears in Trailer 2.","medias":["trailer-2-caracara-016","brian-heder-01"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-caracara-016":"Brian Heder in front of his Vapid pickup in the official GTA VI Trailer 2.","brian-heder-01":"Brian Heder at the wheel of his pickup in an official GTA VI screenshot."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-150%20Raptor","reelNom":"Ford F-150 Raptor","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-caracara-016-480.webp"},{"id":"vapid-ganado","nom":"Ganado ’70","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Ranchero 1970, Mercury Cougar 1969-1970","src":"Official screenshots","note":"The Ganado name and the 434ci marking are readable on the coupe pickup parked in front of Jason’s safehouse.","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"vapid ganado ’70 creado ford ranchero 1970, mercury cougar 1969-1970","txt":"Our official screenshots show this yellow coupe pickup with red stripes in front of Jason’s safehouse in the Keys. The name Ganado can be read on the fender and on the dashboard, along with the 434ci badge, which gives the engine size in cubic inches. It’s a coupe utility in the vein of the Ford Ranchero, and where it sits in Rockstar’s material suggests it belongs to the character. Rockstar has since tied the model to Vapid, after first showing it under the name Creado.","fam":"1970s American coupe utility","alias":"Creado","medias":["ganado-retro-build","jason-s-safehouse-vehicles"],"perso":"jason","vuesDeclarees":["profil","detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Ranchero%201970","reelNom":"Ford Ranchero 1970","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/ganado-retro-build-480.webp"},{"id":"vapid-liberator","nom":"Liberator","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Ford Expedition as a monster truck","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A monster truck with a patriotic paint job, easy to recognize from Trailer 1 onward. It’s built on a big Ford SUV perched on truck axles. This kind of machine almost never drives on the road: it lives on a trailer between two shows, and that’s exactly the kind of detail Rockstar loves to twist.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Expedition%20en%20monster%20truck","reelNom":"Ford Expedition monster truck","search":"vapid liberator ford expedition deuxieme generation en monster truck","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-liberator.svg"},{"id":"vapid-reclaimer","nom":"Reclaimer","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Ranger T6 2019-2023","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A midsize pickup, the format that has won back market share in the United States against full-size trucks that have grown huge. This generation of the Ranger was sold as the sensible middle ground: enough bed to work with, compact enough to park in the city.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Ranger%20T6","reelNom":"Ford Ranger T6","search":"vapid reclaimer ford ranger t6 2019-2023","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-reclaimer.svg"},{"id":"vapid-sandking-xl","nom":"Sandking XL","marque":"Vapid","cat":"pickup","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Super Duty","src":"Trailer 1","search":"vapid sandking xl ford super duty","txt":"The Sandking XL is a pickup lifted on oversized tires, in the spirit of modified Ford F-350s. Lifting trucks like this is especially common in the southern United States, where it’s as much about practical use as about making a statement. The pickup shows up as early as Trailer 1.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Super%20Duty","reelNom":"Ford Super Duty","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-sandking-xl.svg"},{"id":"bravado-bison","nom":"Bison","marque":"Bravado","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Dodge Ram Quad Cab","src":"Trailer 2","search":"bravado bison dodge ram quad cab quatrieme generation","txt":"The Bison is the American work pickup in its most common form: crew cab, short bed, V8 engine. This type of vehicle has been the best seller in the United States, all categories combined, for more than forty years. It can be seen in Trailer 2.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Ram%20Quad%20Cab","reelNom":"Dodge Ram Quad Cab","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-bison.svg"},{"id":"bravado-bison-1800","nom":"Bison 1800","marque":"Bravado","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Ram 1500 DT","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"The modern version of the Bison, based on the DT-generation Ram 1500. Massive grille, crew cab, optional air suspension: the modern American pickup has stopped being a tool and turned into a lifted family sedan, and the sales figures prove it right.","search":"bravado bison 1800 ram 1500 dt","medias":["grassrivers-04"],"imageAlts":{"grassrivers-04":"Pickup in the foreground in a chase through the Grassrivers swamps, GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ram%201500%20DT","reelNom":"Ram 1500 DT","thumb":"/img/officiel/grassrivers-04-480.webp"},{"id":"bravado-bison-900-95","nom":"Bison 900 ’95","marque":"Bravado","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Dodge Ram","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"The Bison in its 90s version, modeled on the second-generation Dodge Ram. This is the model that started the trend for the tall hood and the big-rig-style grille up front, a design that shook up the whole segment. Twenty years later, you still see them everywhere in the South.","search":"bravado bison 900 ’95 dodge ram deuxieme generation","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-053"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-053":"Green pickup and its occupant, official GTA VI Trailer 1 at 00:53"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Ram","reelNom":"Dodge Ram","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-053-480.webp"},{"id":"bravado-rumpo","nom":"Rumpo","marque":"Bravado","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Ford E-Series","txt":"Panel van with solid sides, no rear side windows. The Rumpo has been in the series since GTA III and fills the role of the generic service van.","search":"bravado rumpo ford e-series","src":"Trailer 1","medias":["trailer-1-vehicles-064"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-vehicles-064":"White van on the left of the scene filmed by Weazel News, GTA VI Trailer 1 around 01:04"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20E-Series","reelNom":"Ford E-Series","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-vehicles-064-480.webp"},{"id":"bravado-youga-classic","nom":"Youga Classic","marque":"Bravado","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Second-generation Ford Econoline","src":"Trailer 1","search":"bravado youga classic ford econoline deuxieme generation","txt":"The Youga Classic is the American van of the 70s, the one surfers and touring rock bands drove. This category developed its own look, with airbrushed murals, porthole windows and carpeted interiors. You can spot the van in Trailer 1.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Econoline","reelNom":"Ford Econoline","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-youga-classic.svg"},{"id":"brute-boxville","nom":"Boxville","marque":"Brute","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"GMC Step Van","src":"Official screenshots","search":"brute boxville gmc step van","txt":"The Boxville is the box-bodied delivery truck you see everywhere on American streets. Its shape makes no attempt to look good: it’s as much volume as possible on a chassis, with a sliding door on the side. It appears in the screenshots released by Rockstar.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=GMC%20Step%20Van","reelNom":"GMC Step Van","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/brute-boxville.svg"},{"id":"vapid-bobcat-xl","nom":"Bobcat XL","marque":"Declasse","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Chevrolet C/K","src":"Trailer 1","search":"declasse bobcat xl chevrolet c/k quatrieme generation","txt":"A compact short-bed pickup, the Bobcat XL fills the niche of the small do-it-all truck, the one tradespeople and city services use. Less imposing than an F-150, it’s still practical in the city. The pickup appears in Trailer 1.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20C%2FK","reelNom":"Chevrolet C/K","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-bobcat-xl.svg"},{"id":"declasse-burrito","nom":"Burrito","marque":"Declasse","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Express 1996-2002","src":"Trailer 1","search":"declasse burrito chevrolet express 1996-2002","txt":"The Burrito is the ultimate work van: panel sides, no rear windows, and a three-seat front bench. In the series, it goes hand in hand with heists, which says a lot about how well it blends in. The van clearly shows up in Trailer 1.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Express","reelNom":"Chevrolet Express","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-burrito.svg"},{"id":"coach","nom":"Coach","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"comm","insp":null,"src":"Community match","search":"marque inconnue coach autocar longue distance americain","txt":"The long-distance coach bus is part of the American road landscape, with its side luggage bays and its band of tinted windows. It links the towns the airlines ignore. Model not confirmed by Rockstar for GTA VI.","fam":"American long-distance coach","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Autocar%20longue%20distance%20am%C3%A9ricain","reelNom":"American long-distance coach","thumb":"/img/schemas/coach.svg"},{"id":"ford-econoline-4","nom":"Econoline","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Ford Econoline","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"A short-nose American van, fourth generation. The Econoline was the go-to work van in the United States for decades: plumbers, florists, bands on tour. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue econoline ford econoline quatrieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Econoline","reelNom":"Ford Econoline","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-econoline-4.svg"},{"id":"moocher","nom":"Moocher","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Fleetwood Southwind 1985","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"An 80s motorhome with a boxy body and period decal stripes. The name, which roughly means “freeloader”, says a lot about the kind of character Rockstar pictures behind the wheel. These aging rigs often serve as permanent homes in Florida.","search":"marque inconnue moocher fleetwood southwind 1985","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Fleetwood%20Southwind%201985","reelNom":"Fleetwood Southwind 1985","thumb":"/img/schemas/moocher.svg"},{"id":"rexhall-rose-air","nom":"Rose Air","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Rexhall Rose Air","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A Class A motorhome spotted in the Extended Look. Rexhall was a California maker of mid-range motorhomes that has since gone out of business. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue rose air rexhall rose air","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Rexhall%20Rose%20Air","reelNom":"Rexhall Rose Air","thumb":"/img/schemas/rexhall-rose-air.svg"},{"id":"mercedes-sprinter-2","nom":"Sprinter","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Mercedes-Benz Sprinter","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A premium high-roof van, second generation. The Sprinter created a whole category on its own: reliable enough for business fleets, roomy enough to be turned into a camper. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue sprinter mercedes-benz sprinter","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mercedes-Benz%20Sprinter","reelNom":"Mercedes-Benz Sprinter","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/mercedes-sprinter-2.svg"},{"id":"chrysler-town-country","nom":"Town & Country","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Chrysler Town & Country","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A family minivan with sliding doors, fifth generation. Chrysler invented this format in 1983 and dominated it for thirty years before the SUV swept it away. It’s the suburban family vehicle: everywhere, and completely invisible. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue town & country chrysler town & country","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chrysler%20Town%20%26%20Country","reelNom":"Chrysler Town & Country","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chrysler-town-country.svg"},{"id":"ford-transit-4","nom":"Transit","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Ford Transit","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"A European van brought to the United States in the 2010s to replace the Econoline. Taller, narrower, thriftier: the European idea of the work van, which ended up winning over the US. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue transit ford transit quatrieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Transit","reelNom":"Ford Transit","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-transit-4.svg"},{"id":"ford-transit-cargo-4","nom":"Transit Cargo","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Transit Cargo","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"The panel version of the Transit, with no side windows in the back. It’s the setup delivery drivers and tradespeople use, the one that gives you the most cargo space and the least view of what you’re hauling. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue transit cargo ford transit cargo","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Transit%20Cargo","reelNom":"Ford Transit Cargo","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-transit-cargo-4.svg"},{"id":"vapid-speedo","nom":"Speedo","marque":"Vapid","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Express, 2003 onward","src":"Trailer 1","search":"vapid speedo chevrolet express, depuis 2003","txt":"The Speedo is a compact cab-forward van, in the spirit of city work vans. Its small size makes it the go-to vehicle for downtown deliveries, where a Boxville can’t get through. You can see it drive by in Trailer 1.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Express","reelNom":"Chevrolet Express","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-speedo.svg"},{"id":"zirconium-journey","nom":"Journey","marque":"Zirconium","cat":"van","st":"vu","insp":"1979-1981 Fleetwood Pace Arrow","txt":"A Class A motorhome, the go-to ride for retiring to Florida and for East Coast road trips. The newer Journey II variant is already in this database.","search":"zirconium journey 1979-1981 fleetwood pace arrow","src":"Official screenshots","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Fleetwood%20Pace%20Arrow","reelNom":"Fleetwood Pace Arrow","thumb":"/img/schemas/zirconium-journey.svg"},{"id":"zirconium-journey-ii","nom":"Journey II","marque":"Zirconium","cat":"van","st":"comm","insp":"Winnebago Chieftain","src":"Community match","search":"zirconium journey ii winnebago chieftain","txt":"The Journey II is a Class A motorhome, modeled on the Winnebago Chieftain. The brand name, Zirconium, plays on imitation: zircon is the stone that looks like a diamond without being one. For a budget vacation vehicle, that’s a pretty good joke. These rigs are part of the scenery on Florida roads, especially in winter.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Winnebago%20Chieftain","reelNom":"Winnebago Chieftain","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/zirconium-journey-ii.svg"},{"id":"dinka-double-t","nom":"Double T","marque":"Dinka","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Honda CBR","src":"Trailer 1","search":"dinka double t honda cbr","txt":"The Double T is a faired sport-touring bike, in the line of the Honda CBR. This kind of motorcycle aims for a rare balance: quick enough to be fun, comfortable enough for long rides. Trailer 1 is the source we use for the Double T’s appearance, and its name hasn’t been announced.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20CBR","reelNom":"Honda CBR","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/dinka-double-t.svg"},{"id":"dinka-enduro","nom":"Enduro","marque":"Dinka","cat":"moto","st":"officiel","insp":"Honda XL 350 and XR 500","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"dinka enduro honda xl 350 et xr 500","txt":"The Enduro gets its name from Rockstar’s Ultimate Edition reveal, and our official screenshot gives a clean side view: olive green tank with the Dinka logo, worn black seat, high fender, knobby tires, raised exhaust. It’s an 80s Japanese dual-sport bike, the kind that worked as well on the road as on dirt trails. Another screenshot shows it parked in front of Jason’s safehouse, which suggests it’s his.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["dinka-enduro-motorcycle","jason-s-safehouse-vehicles"],"perso":"jason","vuesDeclarees":["profil"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Honda%20XL%20350","reelNom":"Honda XL 350","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/officiel/dinka-enduro-motorcycle-480.webp"},{"id":"lcc-avarus","nom":"Avarus","marque":"LCC","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Generica mostly-naked chopper","txt":"A chopper with a steeply raked fork, high handlebars and a skinny front wheel. A style straight out of American motorcycle clubs, and one that belongs on long coastal straightaways.","search":"lcc avarus generica mostly-naked chopper","src":"Trailer 2","medias":["trailer-2-motorcycle-143"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-motorcycle-143":"Jason rides a red motorcycle in front of a seaplane in the official GTA VI Trailer 2."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Generica%20mostly-naked%20chopper","reelNom":"Generica mostly-naked chopper","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-motorcycle-143-480.webp"},{"id":"maibatsu-manchez","nom":"Manchez","marque":"Maibatsu","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"500cc KTM","txt":"A light dual-sport bike with a large-diameter front wheel, as comfortable on asphalt as on dirt trails. Handy in the swamps and the backcountry, where roads often run out.","search":"maibatsu manchez 500cc ktm","src":"Official screenshots","medias":["mount-kalaga-national-park-01","ptt-youngin-illegal-goods-store"],"imageAlts":{"mount-kalaga-national-park-01":"Two dirt bikes at Mount Kalaga National Park in GTA VI.","ptt-youngin-illegal-goods-store":"Dirt bike decorated in the PTT YOUNGIN$ shop in GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=500cc%20KTM","reelNom":"500cc KTM","thumb":"/img/officiel/mount-kalaga-national-park-01-480.webp"},{"id":"maibatsu-sanchez","nom":"Sanchez","marque":"Maibatsu","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Yamaha YZ450F 2006-2009","src":"Trailer 1","search":"maibatsu sanchez yamaha yz450f 2006-2009","txt":"The Sanchez is visible in official media, but Rockstar hasn’t given its name. The reference picked for this bike is the Yamaha YZ450F from the 2006 to 2009 model years. The identification and the match come from the community; the logged source is Trailer 1.","medias":["jason-and-lucia-09"],"imageAlts":{"jason-and-lucia-09":"Jason and Lucia on a yellow motorcycle identified as a Maibatsu Sanchez, chased by the police."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Yamaha%20YZ450F","reelNom":"Yamaha YZ450F","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/officiel/jason-and-lucia-09-480.webp"},{"id":"yamaha-bws-125","nom":"BWs 125","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Yamaha BWs 125","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The fat-tire city scooter based on the Yamaha BWs 125, the one you park anywhere and that takes curbs without flinching. The in-game name hasn’t been announced. The Extended Look slips it into the traffic of a residential neighborhood.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Yamaha%20BWs%20125","reelNom":"Yamaha BWs 125","search":"marque inconnue bws 125 yamaha bws 125","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/yamaha-bws-125.svg"},{"id":"suzuki-gsx-r1000","nom":"GSX-R1000","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Suzuki GSX-R1000","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A Japanese sportbike copied line for line from the Suzuki GSX-R1000, with no in-game name or fictional maker so far. It’s the kind of bike you see riding in packs on the boulevards, flat out between two lanes of traffic. The official screenshots show it next to Lucia.","medias":["lucia-caminos-03"],"imageAlts":{"lucia-caminos-03":"Lucia sitting on a yellow motorcycle, matched with a Suzuki GSX-R1000"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Suzuki%20GSX-R1000","reelNom":"Suzuki GSX-R1000","search":"marque inconnue gsx-r1000 suzuki gsx-r1000","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/officiel/lucia-caminos-03-480.webp"},{"id":"pomazoom-mobility-scooter","nom":"Pomazoom","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Pride Maxima 3","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The three-wheel electric mobility scooter you see on sidewalks and in supermarket parking lots, copied from a Pride Maxima 3. Rockstar turned it into a drivable vehicle called the Pomazoom, front basket included. The official screenshots catch it halfway across a parking lot.","medias":["leonida-keys-02"],"imageAlts":{"leonida-keys-02":"Rider of a blue mobility scooter in the Leonida Keys, near an alligator"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Pride%20Maxima%203","reelNom":"Pride Maxima 3","search":"marque inconnue pomazoom pride maxima 3","thumb":"/img/officiel/leonida-keys-02-480.webp"},{"id":"nagasaki-blazer-lifeguard","nom":"Blazer Lifeguard","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"moto","st":"comm","insp":null,"src":"Community match","search":"nagasaki blazer lifeguard quad de plage en configuration de sauvetage","txt":"The rescue version of the Blazer, in lifeguard colors. This kind of quad really is used on the beaches of Miami Beach to patrol and respond quickly on the sand. The link to Leonida comes from players, since no official media has been identified so far.","fam":"Beach quad in lifeguard configuration","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Quad%20de%20plage%20en%20configuration%20de%20sauvetage","reelNom":"Beach quad in lifeguard configuration","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-blazer-lifeguard.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-carbon-rs","nom":"Carbon RS","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Ducati 1199, EBR 1190RS","txt":"A fully faired sportbike with an under-seat exhaust. The Carbon RS is the fastest bike in the previous games, and one of the few that’s as effective in a straight line as it is impossible to ride in the wet.","search":"nagasaki carbon rs ducati 1199, ebr 1190rs","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ducati%201199","reelNom":"Ducati 1199","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-carbon-rs.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-bati-801","nom":"Bati 801","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Ducati 848","src":"Official artwork","txt":"Pegassi’s sportbike, designed after the Ducati 848: a sharp fairing, a tank sculpted for the forearms, and a riding position that folds you in half. It appears in the artwork released by Rockstar, which puts it in the game even before any footage shows it at full speed.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ducati%20848","reelNom":"Ducati 848","search":"pegassi bati 801 ducati 848","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-bati-801.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-faggio","nom":"Faggio","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Piaggio Vespa","src":"Extended Look","search":"pegassi faggio piaggio vespa","txt":"The scooter is the exact opposite of the rest of Pegassi’s lineup, which is what makes the joke funny. The Vespa whose silhouette it borrows is a design icon in its own right, created in 1946 to put Italy back on wheels with as little steel as possible. The Extended Look shows it slipping between two lines of stopped traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Piaggio%20Vespa","reelNom":"Piaggio Vespa","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-faggio.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-faggio-sport","nom":"Faggio Sport","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Piaggio Zip, Peugeot V-Clic and Kymco Agility 50","src":"Extended Look","search":"pegassi faggio sport piaggio zip, peugeot v-clic et kymco agility 50","txt":"The modern version of the Pegassi scooter, with the angular look of today’s little 50 cc scooters: plastic fairing, solid wheels, headlight built into the front shield. Far from the retro charm of the classic Faggio, it’s the ride of delivery workers and high schoolers, the one you see everywhere on the streets of Vice City in the Extended Look. The word Sport promises nothing: it won’t outrun the line of cars it’s weaving past.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Piaggio%20Zip","reelNom":"Piaggio Zip","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-faggio-sport.svg"},{"id":"principe-alvino-v1","nom":"Alvino V1","marque":"Principe","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Ducati Panigale V2 Sport Bike","src":"Official screenshots","search":"principe alvino v1 ducati panigale v2 sport bike","txt":"Principe is this universe’s Italian motorcycle brand, in the Ducati mold. The Alvino V1 is a sport bike with a trellis frame, a design that’s as much the visual signature of these machines as the secret of their stiffness. The official screenshots show it on its kickstand, fairing intact.","medias":["jason-duval-01"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ducati%20Panigale%20V2%20Sport%20Bike","reelNom":"Ducati Panigale V2 Sport Bike","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/jason-duval-01-480.webp"},{"id":"principe-lectro","nom":"Lectro","marque":"Principe","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Ducati Streetfighter S, MV Agusta Brutale S","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A punchy naked bike from Principe, somewhere between the Ducati Streetfighter S and the MV Agusta Brutale S: wide handlebars, exposed trellis frame, nothing to hide from the wind behind. The Extended Look sends it down a coastal road, front wheel going light.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ducati%20Streetfighter%20S","reelNom":"Ducati Streetfighter S","search":"principe lectro ducati streetfighter s, mv agusta brutale s","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/principe-lectro.svg"},{"id":"shitzu-pcj-600","nom":"PCJ-600","marque":"Shitzu","cat":"moto","st":"comm","insp":"Yamaha YZF-R6","src":"Community match","search":"shitzu pcj-600 yamaha yzf-r6","txt":"The PCJ-600 is the series’ entry-level sportbike, modeled on the Yamaha YZF-R6. The 600 cc class was long the gateway to sportbikes: powerful enough to be demanding, light enough to stay easy to handle. No official confirmation.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Yamaha%20YZF-R6","reelNom":"Yamaha YZF-R6","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/shitzu-pcj-600.svg"},{"id":"western-nightblade","nom":"Nightblade","marque":"Western","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Harley-Davidson Night Rod Special","txt":"A big-displacement cruiser with a bulging tank and a low seat. Western is the Harley brand of the GTA universe.","search":"western nightblade harley-davidson night rod special","src":"Official screenshots","medias":["electric-fang-tattoo-01"],"imageAlts":{"electric-fang-tattoo-01":"Two motorcycles parked in front of Electric Fang Tattoo in GTA VI; cruiser with a wide rear tire on the right."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Harley-Davidson%20Night%20Rod%20Special","reelNom":"Harley-Davidson Night Rod Special","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/electric-fang-tattoo-01-480.webp"},{"id":"western-sovereign","nom":"Sovereign","marque":"Western","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Harley Davidson Road King","txt":"A chrome cruiser with wraparound fenders and a detachable windshield. The American touring bike in its most classic form.","search":"western sovereign harley davidson road king","src":"Official screenshots","medias":["ambrosia-01"],"imageAlts":{"ambrosia-01":"Group of bikers riding through Ambrosia in GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Harley%20Davidson%20Road%20King","reelNom":"Harley Davidson Road King","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/ambrosia-01-480.webp"},{"id":"western-zombie-chopper","nom":"Zombie Chopper","marque":"Western","cat":"moto","st":"vu","insp":"Harley Davidson Fat Bob Custom, Iron 883","src":"Trailer 2","search":"western zombie chopper harley davidson fat bob custom, iron 883","txt":"The Zombie Chopper is an American custom with a long fork, in the Harley-Davidson Fat Bob Custom and Iron 883 tradition. The chopper was born from the habit of stripping a stock bike of everything that isn’t essential, hence the name. The Zombie Chopper is listed in Trailer 2, under a community identification.","medias":["electric-fang-tattoo-01"],"imageAlts":{"electric-fang-tattoo-01":"Two motorcycles parked in front of Electric Fang Tattoo in GTA VI; chopper on the left."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Harley%20Davidson%20Fat%20Bob%20Custom","reelNom":"Harley Davidson Fat Bob Custom","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/electric-fang-tattoo-01-480.webp"},{"id":"buckingham-maverick","nom":"Maverick","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"Bell 206L Longranger","src":"Official screenshots","search":"buckingham maverick bell 206l longranger","txt":"The Maverick shows up on screen without Rockstar releasing its name. It borrows the design of the Bell 206 LongRanger, a stretched version of one of the most-produced civilian helicopters in the world: seven seats, a single turbine engine, and a reliability that made it the go-to aircraft for news channels and police departments.","medias":["mount-kalaga-national-park-02"],"imageAlts":{"mount-kalaga-national-park-02":"Red and white Maverick helicopter flying in front of the hills, with a passenger at the open door."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Bell%20206L%20Longranger","reelNom":"Bell 206L Longranger","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/mount-kalaga-national-park-02-480.webp"},{"id":"buckingham-police-maverick","nom":"Police Maverick","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"Eurocopter AS350B","txt":"The police helicopter, with a searchlight and a camera. It shows up at high wanted levels and adds pressure from above that you can’t answer if you stay on the ground.","search":"buckingham police maverick eurocopter as350b","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Eurocopter%20AS350B","reelNom":"Eurocopter AS350B","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-police-maverick.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-supervolito","nom":"SuperVolito","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"Eurocopter EC145","src":"Trailer 1","search":"buckingham supervolito eurocopter ec145","txt":"A twin-turbine business helicopter, the SuperVolito is modeled on the Eurocopter EC145. This class of aircraft is used as much to fly executives around as to serve offshore oil platforms, a common job in the Gulf of Mexico. Trailer 1 shows it flying over the bay on approach.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Eurocopter%20EC145","reelNom":"Eurocopter EC145","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-supervolito.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-swift","nom":"Swift","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"AgustaWestland AW109, Bell 222","src":"Official screenshots","search":"buckingham swift agustawestland aw109, bell 222","txt":"The Swift is a private transport helicopter in the vein of the AgustaWestland AW109: sleek silhouette, retractable landing gear, a well-finished cabin. It’s the aircraft for anyone who wants to skip the traffic jams between the business district and the marina. The official screenshots show it sitting on a rooftop helipad.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=AgustaWestland%20AW109","reelNom":"AgustaWestland AW109","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-swift.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-valkyrie","nom":"Valkyrie","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"Bell UH-1Y Venom, Bell 412","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Buckingham’s transport helicopter, a direct descendant of the Bell UH-1 and its Venom and 412 versions, with a Fenestron-style ducted tail rotor. Sliding side doors and a cabin open at the sides. The Extended Look follows it in low-altitude flight.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Bell%20UH-1Y%20Venom","reelNom":"Bell UH-1Y Venom","search":"buckingham valkyrie bell uh-1y venom, bell 412","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-valkyrie.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-buzzard","nom":"Buzzard","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"AH-6 Little Bird","src":"Trailer 2","search":"nagasaki buzzard ah-6 little bird","txt":"The Buzzard is back in Rockstar’s official media. It’s a light two-seat helicopter, modeled on the AH-6 Little Bird, a compact aircraft used by US special forces precisely because it can land in tight spaces, rooftops included.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=AH-6%20Little%20Bird","reelNom":"AH-6 Little Bird","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-buzzard.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-police-buzzard","nom":"Police Buzzard","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"MH-6 Little Bird","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The police version of the Buzzard, with a livery close to that of the Miami Police Department’s aircraft. The MH-6 Little Bird it’s modeled on is a light helicopter of military origin, picked by city police forces for its small size and modest operating costs.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=MH-6%20Little%20Bird","reelNom":"MH-6 Little Bird","search":"nagasaki police buzzard mh-6 little bird","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-police-buzzard.svg"},{"id":"western-sea-sparrow","nom":"Sea Sparrow","marque":"Western","cat":"helicoptere","st":"vu","insp":"Sikorsky S-300, formerly Hughes 300","src":"Trailer 1","search":"western sea sparrow sikorsky s-300, anciennement hughes 300","txt":"The Sea Sparrow is a light helicopter mounted on floats. The inspiration we picked is the Sikorsky S-300, formerly Hughes 300. Our database ties it to Trailer 1, with no name given; the floats set it apart from the land version.","medias":["cover-art-sea-sparrow"],"imageAlts":{"cover-art-sea-sparrow":"Blue helicopter with floats in an illustration from the official GTA VI cover art"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Sikorsky%20S-300","reelNom":"Sikorsky S-300","thumb":"/img/officiel/cover-art-sea-sparrow-480.webp"},{"id":"buckingham-luxor","nom":"Luxor","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Learjet 45","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Buckingham’s high-end business jet, built on a Learjet 45 like the Shamal but with a far more polished interior. It’s the plane for low-key arrivals on a private runway. The Extended Look shows it on the ground, with its airstair down.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Learjet%2045","reelNom":"Learjet 45","search":"buckingham luxor learjet 45","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-luxor.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-nimbus","nom":"Nimbus","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Cessna Citation X","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A twin-engine business jet modeled on the Cessna Citation X, for a long time the fastest civilian plane on the market. Slim fuselage, sharply swept wings, engines mounted at the tail. Trailer 1 shows it crossing the Leonida sky at high altitude.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cessna%20Citation%20X","reelNom":"Cessna Citation X","search":"buckingham nimbus cessna citation x","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/buckingham-nimbus.svg"},{"id":"buckingham-shamal","nom":"Shamal","marque":"Buckingham","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Learjet 45","src":"Official screenshots","search":"buckingham shamal learjet 45","txt":"Rockstar lets it be seen in its artwork but keeps its name to itself. It’s a business jet modeled on the Learjet 45: narrow fuselage, engines at the tail, T-tail. The Learjet defined business aviation as a category in the 60s, with a proud “civilian fighter jet” philosophy.","medias":["vice-city-01"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Learjet%2045","reelNom":"Learjet 45","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/vice-city-01-480.webp"},{"id":"jobuilt-mammatus","nom":"Mammatus","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Cessna 172 Skyhawk","src":"Official screenshots","search":"jobuilt mammatus cessna 172 skyhawk","txt":"The plane can be spotted in Rockstar’s images, but the caption says nothing about it. A small high-wing single-engine plane in the spirit of the Cessnas, it’s the kind of aircraft that fills Florida’s airfields: pilot training, discovery flights, private trips. Our map lists several of these airfields.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cessna%20172%20Skyhawk","reelNom":"Cessna 172 Skyhawk","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/jobuilt-mammatus.svg"},{"id":"mammoth-dodo","nom":"Dodo","marque":"Mammoth","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"De Havilland Canada DHC-2 Beaver","src":"Trailer 1","search":"mammoth dodo de havilland canada dhc-2 beaver","txt":"Rockstar shows it without ever calling it by name. It’s a high-wing seaplane modeled on the De Havilland Beaver, a Canadian plane designed for short takeoffs and water landings. Between the Keys, the swamps and Leonida’s countless bodies of water, the use is obvious.","medias":["leonida-keys-01"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=De%20Havilland%20Canada%20DHC-2%20Beaver","reelNom":"De Havilland Canada DHC-2 Beaver","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/officiel/leonida-keys-01-480.webp"},{"id":"mammoth-streamer216","nom":"Streamer216","marque":"Mammoth","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"De Havilland Canada DHC-6 Twin Otter","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"The high-wing twin-engine plane of the island-hopping routes, based on De Havilland Canada’s DHC-6 Twin Otter. It takes off short, lands on rough strips and carries around fifteen passengers. Trailer 2 catches it on final approach.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=De%20Havilland%20Canada%20DHC-6%20Twin%20Otter","reelNom":"De Havilland Canada DHC-6 Twin Otter","search":"mammoth streamer216 de havilland canada dhc-6 twin otter","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/mammoth-streamer216.svg"},{"id":"jet","nom":"Jet","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Boeing 747-400, 747-8I","txt":"A commercial airliner. Its presence at Vice City’s international airport is mostly for show, but the series has always ended up making them flyable.","search":"marque inconnue jet boeing 747-400, 747-8i","src":"Trailer 2","medias":["trailer-2-jet-037"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-jet-037":"Four-engine airliner above the signs to VCI Airport, GTA VI Trailer 2 around 00:37."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Boeing%20747-400","reelNom":"Boeing 747-400","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-jet-037-480.webp"},{"id":"western-company-duster","nom":"Duster","marque":"Western Company","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Stearman Model 75","src":"Official screenshots","search":"western company duster stearman model 75","txt":"The biplane shows up in the official images, unnamed. It’s an agricultural crop-dusting biplane, in the line of the Stearman Model 75: truss frame, open cockpit, fixed landing gear. These planes, often converted former military trainers, still fly over farms in the American South.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Stearman%20Model%2075","reelNom":"Stearman Model 75","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/western-company-duster.svg"},{"id":"xero-blimp","nom":"Blimp","marque":"Xero","cat":"avion","st":"vu","insp":"Goodyear Aerospace GZ-20","src":"Trailer 1","search":"xero blimp goodyear aerospace gz-20","txt":"The advertising blimp is part of the American landscape, especially over stadiums and big events. Xero is the universe’s oil brand, and this kind of advertising partnership is true to life. The blimp is definitely there in the images; its name isn’t.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Goodyear%20Aerospace%20GZ-20","reelNom":"Goodyear Aerospace GZ-20","thumb":"/img/schemas/xero-blimp.svg"},{"id":"airboat-09","nom":"Airboat 09","marque":"Airgator","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Diamondback Hunting & Fishing airboat","src":"Official screenshots","search":"airgator airboat 09 hydroglisseur diamondback hunting & fishing","txt":"The airboat is inseparable from the Everglades: flat hull, airplane engine at the stern, raised tiers of seats for tourist rides. It glides over a few inches of water and cuts through the grass beds. The name Airgator is a clear nod to the alligators these machines take visitors to see.","medias":["grassrivers-01"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Hydroglisseur%20Diamondback%20Hunting%20%26%20Fishing","reelNom":"Diamondback Hunting & Fishing airboat","thumb":"/img/officiel/grassrivers-01-480.webp"},{"id":"btn-delmar","nom":"Delmar","marque":"BTN","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"BTN Delmar","src":"Trailer 1","search":"btn delmar btn delmar","txt":"The Delmar is a coastal fishing boat with a cabin, the kind that heads out for the day from Florida marinas. It’s built for work: open deck, rod holders, high freeboard. Trailer 1 shows it moored along a dock.","fam":"Coastal fishing boat with a cabin","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BTN%20Delmar","reelNom":"BTN Delmar","thumb":"/img/schemas/btn-delmar.svg"},{"id":"crest-kayak","nom":"Kayak","marque":"Crest","cat":"bateau","st":"officiel","insp":"Crescent kayak, several variants","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"crest kayak kayak crescent, plusieurs variantes","txt":"The kayak is named by Rockstar, and our official screenshot shows it in use at sunset, with the Crest brand readable on the hull. It’s a sit-on-top sea kayak, an open boat especially well suited to the warm, shallow waters of the Keys. Another screenshot shows it sitting in front of Jason’s safehouse.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["crest-kayak","jason-s-safehouse-vehicles","mount-kalaga-national-park-06"],"perso":"jason","imageAlts":{"mount-kalaga-national-park-06":"Orange Crest kayak on a river under a railroad bridge in Mount Kalaga National Park."},"vuesDeclarees":["profil"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Kayak%20Crescent","reelNom":"Kayak Crescent","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/crest-kayak-480.webp"},{"id":"dinka-jetmax","nom":"Jetmax","marque":"Dinka","cat":"bateau","st":"comm","insp":null,"src":"Community match","search":"dinka jetmax hors-bord de sport a coque en v","txt":"The Jetmax is a sport speedboat, built for speed on calm water: sleek hull, low cockpit, oversized engine. The sheltered bays of Vice City are the perfect playground for it. Model not confirmed by Rockstar.","fam":"V-hull sport speedboat","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Hors-bord%20de%20sport%20%C3%A0%20coque%20en%20V","reelNom":"V-hull sport speedboat","thumb":"/img/schemas/dinka-jetmax.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-marquis","nom":"Marquis","marque":"Dinka","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Adjutor Yachts","src":"Trailer 2","search":"dinka marquis adjutor yachts","txt":"The Marquis is listed as a cruising sailboat, with Adjutor Yachts as its inspiration. The brand used in our database is Dinka. Its appearance is tied to Trailer 2, with no official caption giving its name.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Adjutor%20Yachts","reelNom":"Adjutor Yachts","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-marquis.svg"},{"id":"lure-predator-l35p","nom":"Predator L35P","marque":"Lure","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Contender 25T","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A center-console fishing boat with a T-top and outriggers. The Lure Predator brand is visible in the official screenshots, which makes it one of the game’s few named boats. There’s also a police livery version.","search":"lure predator l35p contender 25t","medias":["leonida-keys-05"],"imageAlts":{"leonida-keys-05":"Boats gathered in the Leonida Keys, with a speedboat marked Lure Predator in the foreground."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Contender%2025T","reelNom":"Contender 25T","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/leonida-keys-05-480.webp"},{"id":"lure-predator-l35p-police","nom":"Police Predator L35P","marque":"Lure","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Contender 25T","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A law enforcement livery version of the Predator L35P: emergency lights, reflective stripes, searchlight. Marine police are part of everyday life in a state with so many canals and so much coastline, and they step in during chases on the water.","search":"lure predator l35p de police contender 25t","medias":["shitzu-squalo-04"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Contender%2025T","reelNom":"Contender 25T","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/shitzu-squalo-04-480.webp"},{"id":"lure-predator-s23","nom":"Predator S23","marque":"Lure","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Contender 25 Bay","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A small shallow-water fishing boat, seven meters long, with a shallow-draft hull built for bays and mangroves. It’s the most common setup among Florida anglers, a far cry from offshore boats.","search":"lure predator s23 contender 25 bay","medias":["leonida-keys-05"],"imageAlts":{"leonida-keys-05":"Boats gathered in the Leonida Keys, with a speedboat marked Lure Predator in the foreground."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Contender%2025%20Bay","reelNom":"Contender 25 Bay","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/leonida-keys-05-480.webp"},{"id":"azimut-85","nom":"Azimut 85","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Azimut 85","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"A twenty-six-meter motor yacht, in the class of large cruising yachts. The Azimut 85 comes from an Italian shipyard whose boats fill the marinas of Miami Beach. Rockstar hasn’t announced its in-game name.","search":"marque inconnue azimut 85 azimut 85","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Azimut%2085","reelNom":"Azimut 85","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/azimut-85.svg"},{"id":"azimut-atlantis-45","nom":"Azimut Atlantis 45","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Azimut Atlantis 45","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"A fourteen-meter cabin cruiser, the middle ground between a day speedboat and a yacht you can live on. It’s the boat of a well-off owner who heads out on weekends, not a shipowner’s. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue azimut atlantis 45 azimut atlantis 45","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Azimut%20Atlantis%2045","reelNom":"Azimut Atlantis 45","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/azimut-atlantis-45.svg"},{"id":"fishing-boat","nom":"Fishing boat","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Steiger Craft 31 Miami","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A coastal fishing boat with an enclosed cabin, nine meters long. The Steiger Craft whose lines it borrows literally carries the name Miami in its model designation. It’s a pro fisherman’s tool rather than a weekend boater’s toy.","search":"marque inconnue bateau de peche steiger craft 31 miami","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Steiger%20Craft%2031%20Miami","reelNom":"Steiger Craft 31 Miami","thumb":"/img/schemas/fishing-boat.svg"},{"id":"water-taxi","nom":"Water taxi","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Miami water taxi","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A passenger river shuttle, spotted in the Extended Look. Miami runs a real water taxi network between downtown, the beach and the islands. Its presence in Leonida suggests an extra way to get around, separate from the bus and the elevated metro.","search":"marque inconnue bateau-taxi bateau-taxi de miami","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Bateau-taxi%20de%20Miami","reelNom":"Miami water taxi","thumb":"/img/schemas/water-taxi.svg"},{"id":"bavaria-sr33","nom":"Bavaria SR33","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Bavaria SR33","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A German deep-hull sport boat, built for rough seas rather than the lagoon. Bavaria is best known for its sailboats, and this powerboat range is its shot at the sport boat market. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue bavaria sr33 bavaria sr33","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Bavaria%20SR33","reelNom":"Bavaria SR33","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/bavaria-sr33.svg"},{"id":"clarion","nom":"Clarion","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Cigarette 38 Top Gun","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A racing powerboat with a very slim hull, in the line of the Cigarette 38 Top Gun. These boats have a heavy history in Miami: built for offshore racing, they were widely used by 1980s smugglers because they could outrun the customs patrol boats. Hard to find a better fit for Vice City.","search":"marque inconnue clarion cigarette 38 top gun","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Cigarette%2038%20Top%20Gun","reelNom":"Cigarette 38 Top Gun","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/clarion.svg"},{"id":"contender-39st","nom":"Contender 39ST","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Contender 39ST","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A twelve-meter center-console boat for big-game fishing, with four outboard motors on the stern. Contender is a South Florida boatbuilder whose boats are built to run far and fast. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue contender 39st contender 39st","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Contender%2039ST","reelNom":"Contender 39ST","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/contender-39st.svg"},{"id":"crownline-275-ss","nom":"Crownline 275 SS","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Crownline 275 SS","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"An eight-meter leisure bowrider, with an open cockpit and a bow seat. It’s the classic American family boat: waterskiing, swimming, drinks at anchor. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue crownline 275 ss crownline 275 ss","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Crownline%20275%20SS","reelNom":"Crownline 275 SS","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/crownline-275-ss.svg"},{"id":"crusader-boats-gfy","nom":"Crusader Boats GFY","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Crusader Boats GFY","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A ten-meter dive boat with an open deck, a rear platform and a tank rack. Florida’s reefs support a whole economy of dive trips, and this is exactly the kind of boat people rent for the day. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue crusader boats gfy crusader boats gfy","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Crusader%20Boats%20GFY","reelNom":"Crusader Boats GFY","thumb":"/img/schemas/crusader-boats-gfy.svg"},{"id":"shipyard-de-hoop-brion","nom":"De Hoop Brion","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Shipyard De Hoop Brion","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A Dutch service vessel with a workboat hull and a deck crane. It’s neither a pleasure boat nor a fishing boat, but one of those utility ships that crowd commercial ports. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue de hoop brion shipyard de hoop brion","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Shipyard%20De%20Hoop%20Brion","reelNom":"Shipyard De Hoop Brion","thumb":"/img/schemas/shipyard-de-hoop-brion.svg"},{"id":"ferry","nom":"Ferry","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Fisher Island ferry","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A passenger and vehicle ferry, modeled on the ones that serve Fisher Island, the private island off Miami Beach you can only reach by boat. Its presence suggests that part of the Leonida map isn’t connected by road.","search":"marque inconnue ferry ferry de fisher island","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ferry%20de%20Fisher%20Island","reelNom":"Fisher Island ferry","thumb":"/img/schemas/ferry.svg"},{"id":"frauscher-1017-gt","nom":"Frauscher 1017 GT","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Frauscher 1017 GT","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"An Austrian day boat with very sculpted lines, ten meters long. Frauscher shapes its hulls like sports car bodies, which gives it a reputation all its own in the boating world. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue frauscher 1017 gt frauscher 1017 gt","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Frauscher%201017%20GT","reelNom":"Frauscher 1017 GT","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/frauscher-1017-gt.svg"},{"id":"highfield-sport-900","nom":"Highfield Sport 900","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Highfield Sport 900","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A nine-meter rigid inflatable boat, with an aluminum hull and inflatable tubes. These boats serve as tenders for big yachts and as fast shuttles between the anchorage and the shore. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue highfield sport 900 highfield sport 900","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Highfield%20Sport%20900","reelNom":"Highfield Sport 900","thumb":"/img/schemas/highfield-sport-900.svg"},{"id":"horizon-power-catamarans-pc60","nom":"Horizon PC60","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Horizon Power Catamarans PC60","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"An eighteen-meter power catamaran. The twin hulls give it stability and living space that a monohull of the same length can’t match, at the cost of a width that makes mooring harder. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue horizon pc60 horizon power catamarans pc60","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Horizon%20Power%20Catamarans%20PC60","reelNom":"Horizon Power Catamarans PC60","thumb":"/img/schemas/horizon-power-catamarans-pc60.svg"},{"id":"lurssen-73m-coral-ocean","nom":"Lürssen 73m","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Lürssen Coral Ocean","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A 73-meter superyacht, the top of the game’s nautical pecking order. Lürssen is the German shipyard that builds the world’s largest private yachts. A ship like that at anchor isn’t a vehicle, it’s scenery, and a status symbol. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue lurssen 73m lurssen coral ocean","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=L%C3%BCrssen%20Coral%20Ocean","reelNom":"Lürssen Coral Ocean","thumb":"/img/schemas/lurssen-73m-coral-ocean.svg"},{"id":"cruise-ship","nom":"Cruise ship","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Royal Caribbean Voyager","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A cruise ship, one of the biggest moving objects in the game. The Port of Miami is the top cruise port in the world, and these ships are as much a part of the city’s skyline as its hotels. It’s unlikely you’ll be able to pilot it, but its presence in the port shapes the scenery.","search":"marque inconnue paquebot de croisiere royal caribbean voyager","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Royal%20Caribbean%20Voyager","reelNom":"Royal Caribbean Voyager","thumb":"/img/schemas/cruise-ship.svg"},{"id":"rb-s","nom":"RB-S","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Coast Guard RB-S boat","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"A Coast Guard response boat with a rigid hull, an inflatable collar and outboard motors. The Response Boat Small is the US Coast Guard’s standard patrol unit. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue rb-s vedette garde-cotes rb-s","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Vedette%20garde-c%C3%B4tes%20RB-S","reelNom":"Coast Guard RB-S boat","thumb":"/img/schemas/rb-s.svg"},{"id":"rb-s-ii","nom":"RB-S II","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Coast Guard RB-S II boat","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The second generation of the Coast Guard patrol boat, longer and more powerful. It patrols the coastline and the inlets, while the marine police stick to inland waters. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue rb-s ii vedette garde-cotes rb-s ii","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Vedette%20garde-c%C3%B4tes%20RB-S%20II","reelNom":"Coast Guard RB-S II boat","thumb":"/img/schemas/rb-s-ii.svg"},{"id":"riva-86-domino","nom":"Riva 86 Domino","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Riva 86 Domino","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A twenty-six-meter Italian yacht. Riva is to boats what Ferrari is to cars: a name that works as shorthand for wealth and taste. The Domino is its modern take, all glass and taut lines. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue riva 86 domino riva 86 domino","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Riva%2086%20Domino","reelNom":"Riva 86 Domino","slot":"europeen","thumb":"/img/schemas/riva-86-domino.svg"},{"id":"sea-ray-350-sundancer","nom":"Sea Ray 350 Sundancer","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Sea Ray 350 Sundancer","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"An eleven-meter cabin cruiser, with a berth and a galley below deck. Sea Ray is the biggest American maker of pleasure boats, and the Sundancer is its best-selling line. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue sea ray 350 sundancer sea ray 350 sundancer","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Sea%20Ray%20350%20Sundancer","reelNom":"Sea Ray 350 Sundancer","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/sea-ray-350-sundancer.svg"},{"id":"sea-doo-rxt-x-300","nom":"Sea-Doo RXT-X 300","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Sea-Doo RXT-X 300","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A high-powered three-seat jet ski, separate from the Seashark that’s already in this database. The RXT-X is the sporty version of the lineup, the one that goes past a hundred kilometers per hour. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue sea-doo rxt-x 300 sea-doo rxt-x 300","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Sea-Doo%20RXT-X%20300","reelNom":"Sea-Doo RXT-X 300","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/sea-doo-rxt-x-300.svg"},{"id":"skater-388","nom":"Skater 388","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Skater 388","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"An offshore racing catamaran, its hull split by a central tunnel that lifts the boat at high speed. These machines top two hundred kilometers per hour and have no use beyond racing and showing off. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue skater 388 skater 388","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Skater%20388","reelNom":"Skater 388","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/skater-388.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-dinghy","nom":"Dinghy","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Rigid-hulled inflatable boat","src":"Trailer 2","search":"nagasaki dinghy rigid-hulled inflatable boat","txt":"The Dinghy is a rigid inflatable: a hard hull topped with inflatable tubes. It’s the go-to tender, used to reach a boat at anchor, for diving or for quick rescue runs. Trailer 2 shows it speeding between two mangrove banks.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Rigid-hulled%20inflatable%20boat","reelNom":"Rigid-hulled inflatable boat","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-dinghy.svg"},{"id":"pegassi-speeder","nom":"Speeder","marque":"Pegassi","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Coeur 290 Nighthawk, Cherubini Classic 20","src":"Trailer 1","search":"pegassi speeder coeur 290 nighthawk, cherubini classic 20","txt":"The Speeder is a high-performance speedboat in the vein of the Cigarette Racing boats. These deep-V-hull boats have a special history in Miami: built for offshore racing in the ’70s, they were quickly taken up for other activities along the Florida coast. Trailer 1 has it running flat out, bow out of the water.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Coeur%20290%20Nighthawk","reelNom":"Coeur 290 Nighthawk","thumb":"/img/schemas/pegassi-speeder.svg"},{"id":"shitzu-longfin","nom":"Longfin","marque":"Shitzu","cat":"bateau","st":"comm","insp":"Offshore sport fishing boat","txt":"A big-game fishing boat with a tall cabin, an arch and outriggers. The kind of boat you rent by the day all along the Florida coast, and that also gets used, in fiction as in real life, for other kinds of business.","search":"shitzu longfin vedette de peche hauturiere","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Vedette%20de%20p%C3%AAche%20hauturi%C3%A8re","reelNom":"Offshore sport fishing boat","thumb":"/img/schemas/shitzu-longfin.svg"},{"id":"shitzu-squalo","nom":"Squalo","marque":"Shitzu","cat":"bateau","st":"officiel","insp":"Chris-Craft Stinger 390x","src":"Ultimate Edition","vues":[],"credit":"Official Rockstar Games screenshot","search":"shitzu squalo chris-craft stinger 390x","txt":"The Squalo’s name is spelled out in the Ultimate Edition presentation, and the official screenshots leave no doubt: the Shitzu logo and the Squalo name are readable on the hull and the windshield. You can see the palm-leaf livery, the teak deck, the fishing rods, a scuba tank and the registration number VB 0522 05. The hull is that of the Chris-Craft Stinger 390x, an 80s sport speedboat whose low profile and pointed nose are inseparable from the image of Miami.","edition":"Ultimate Edition","medias":["shitzu-squalo-01","shitzu-squalo-02","shitzu-squalo-03","shitzu-squalo-04"],"vuesDeclarees":["face","profil","arriere","detail"],"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chris-Craft%20Stinger%20390x","reelNom":"Chris-Craft Stinger 390x","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/shitzu-squalo-01-480.webp"},{"id":"shitzu-tropic","nom":"Tropic","marque":"Shitzu","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Sea Ray 300 Sundancer","src":"Trailer 1","search":"shitzu tropic sea ray 300 sundancer","txt":"The Tropic is a leisure cabin cruiser, modeled on the Sea Ray 300 Sundancer. It’s the classic American family boat: roomy enough to sleep on board, seaworthy enough to head out of the bay, and sold by the thousands all along the Florida coast. The kind of boat you find tied up behind the houses along the canals.","medias":["trailer-1-tropic-011"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-tropic-011":"White cabin cruiser seen from above near the dolphins, GTA VI Trailer 1 around 00:11."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Sea%20Ray%20300%20Sundancer","reelNom":"Sea Ray 300 Sundancer","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-tropic-011-480.webp"},{"id":"speedophile-seashark","nom":"Seashark","marque":"Speedophile","cat":"bateau","st":"officiel","insp":"Sea-Doo GTX","src":"Trailer 2","search":"speedophile seashark sea-doo gtx","txt":"Its name can be read on the side of the hull in Trailer 2, when Jason and Lucia cross the bay on it at full speed. It’s a three-seat jet ski, modeled on the Sea-Doo GTX: jet-pump propulsion, composite hull, no visible propeller. The brand name is one of the most blatant jokes in the catalog.","medias":["trailer-2-seashark-141"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-seashark-141":"Jason and Lucia on a green jet ski; the Seashark name is readable on the hull, GTA VI Trailer 2 around 02:21."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Sea-Doo%20GTX","reelNom":"Sea-Doo GTX","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-seashark-141-480.webp"},{"id":"vortex-airboat","nom":"Airboat","marque":"Vortex","cat":"bateau","st":"vu","insp":"Panther Airboat","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"The airboat is GTA VI’s real new addition on the water: never seen before in the series. With its flat hull and a huge caged air propeller, it skims over a few inches of water and goes where no hull can. This kind of craft is tied to the Florida swamps. How well it gets around the Grassrivers is still to be checked in the game.","search":"vortex airboat hydroglisseur panther airboat","medias":["grassrivers-03"],"imageAlts":{"grassrivers-03":"Airboat seen from above among alligators and water plants in Grassrivers."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Hydroglisseur%20Panther%20Airboat","reelNom":"Panther Airboat","thumb":"/img/officiel/grassrivers-03-480.webp"},{"id":"bravado-bison-1800-police","nom":"Bison 1800 (Police)","marque":"Bravado","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ram 1500 DT","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The patrol version of the Bison 1800. Agencies in South Florida really do use pickups this size for off-pavement calls, on wetland trails or beach access roads where a regular police car gets stuck.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ram%201500%20DT","reelNom":"Ram 1500 DT","search":"bravado bison 1800 (police) ram 1500 dt","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-bison-1800-police.svg"},{"id":"bravado-buffalo-stx-pursuit","nom":"Buffalo STX Pursuit","marque":"Bravado","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Charger Pursuit","src":"Trailer 1","search":"bravado buffalo stx pursuit dodge charger pursuit","txt":"Patrol version of the Buffalo STX: light bar, department livery, heavy-duty suspension and cooling. In the United States, automakers really do sell certified police variants, mechanically different from the civilian models. Trailer 1 sends it into a chase with its lights flashing.","medias":["jason-and-lucia-09","vice-city-06"],"imageAlts":{"jason-and-lucia-09":"Jason and Lucia on a yellow motorcycle identified as a Maibatsu Sanchez, chased by the police.","vice-city-06":"Vice Beach Police Buffalo STX surrounded by officers and passersby outside the Ocean View Hotel."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Charger%20Pursuit","reelNom":"Dodge Charger Pursuit","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/jason-and-lucia-09-480.webp"},{"id":"bravado-gauntlet-interceptor","nom":"Gauntlet Interceptor","marque":"Bravado","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Police Dodge Challenger","src":"Trailer 1","search":"bravado gauntlet interceptor dodge challenger en configuration de police","txt":"Interceptor version of the Gauntlet, built for pursuit rather than patrol. US police departments regularly field muscle cars in this role, less for how effective they really are than for the deterrent effect. Trailer 1 puts it sideways across the road, doors open.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Challenger%20en%20configuration%20de%20police","reelNom":"Police Dodge Challenger","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-gauntlet-interceptor.svg"},{"id":"bravado-police-cruiser-buffalo","nom":"Police Cruiser (Buffalo)","marque":"Bravado","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Charger","txt":"The Buffalo in city patrol livery. Leonida’s law enforcement doesn’t use the same vehicle everywhere: the city, the highway and the backcountry each have their own setup.","search":"bravado police cruiser (buffalo) dodge charger","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Charger","reelNom":"Dodge Charger","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/bravado-police-cruiser-buffalo.svg"},{"id":"brute-ambulance","nom":"Ambulance","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Express 3500 cutaway","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Leonida’s ambulance follows the usual American format: a Chevrolet Express cutaway chassis topped with an add-on patient module, wider than the cab. In the US, these boxes are fitted by specialist upfitters, which explains the sharp break in the body line just behind the front doors.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Express%203500%20ch%C3%A2ssis-cabine","reelNom":"Chevrolet Express 3500 cutaway","search":"brute ambulance chevrolet express 3500 chassis-cabine","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/brute-ambulance.svg"},{"id":"brute-bus","nom":"Bus","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"New Flyer Xcelsior","txt":"Low-floor city bus. Stops are marked on our map. This vehicle is documented in official media, while the ways the player can use it still need to be checked in the game.","search":"brute bus new flyer xcelsior","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=New%20Flyer%20Xcelsior","reelNom":"New Flyer Xcelsior","thumb":"/img/schemas/brute-bus.svg"},{"id":"brute-police-riot","nom":"Police Riot","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Lenco BEAR","src":"Trailer 2","search":"brute police riot lenco bear","txt":"The armored riot-control truck shows up on screen, but its name is still unknown. These vehicles, often military surplus handed down to local police, have become a topic of public debate in the United States. Their presence in a city like Vice City is no small detail.","medias":["trailer-2-police-riot-119"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-2-police-riot-119":"Black armored truck facing Lucia, to the left of the car thrown by the explosion, GTA VI Trailer 2 around 01:59."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lenco%20BEAR","reelNom":"Lenco BEAR","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-2-police-riot-119-480.webp"},{"id":"brute-rental-shuttle-bus","nom":"Rental Shuttle Bus","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"1996-2002 Chevrolet Express","txt":"Shuttle minibus, the one that links the terminals to the parking lots and hotels. A vehicle you only notice at airports, and Leonida has several.","search":"brute rental shuttle bus 1996-2002 chevrolet express","src":"Trailer 2","medias":["leonida-keys-02"],"imageAlts":{"leonida-keys-02":"White minibus on the right in the Leonida Keys street scene in GTA VI."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Express","reelNom":"Chevrolet Express","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/officiel/leonida-keys-02-480.webp"},{"id":"brute-stockade","nom":"Stockade","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"International 4700 Series","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The armored cash-in-transit truck, built on the same International 4700 chassis as the Benson but fitted with a reinforced box with gun ports cut into it. It’s as much a heist target as a vehicle. The Extended Look shows it parked in front of a bank branch.","medias":["extended-look-stockade"],"imageAlts":{"extended-look-stockade":"Armored truck in the middle of the street, still from An Extended Look"},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=International%204700%20Series","reelNom":"International 4700 Series","search":"brute stockade international 4700 series","thumb":"/img/officiel/extended-look-stockade-480.webp"},{"id":"brute-tipper-6-wheels","nom":"Tipper (6 wheels)","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Kodiak, GMC TopKick","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Brute’s six-wheel dump truck, built on a Kodiak and TopKick base: two rear axles, a tipping bed, and a size somewhere between a light-duty truck and a heavy truck. The Extended Look shows it driving fully loaded on a dirt road at a construction site.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Kodiak","reelNom":"Chevrolet Kodiak","search":"brute tipper (6 roues) chevrolet kodiak, gmc topkick","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/brute-tipper-6-wheels.svg"},{"id":"brute-utility-truck","nom":"Utility Truck","marque":"Brute","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"International 4700 Series","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Brute’s maintenance truck, with a bucket lift folded down on the bed and toolboxes along the sides, built on an International 4700 Series chassis. It’s the truck used by the crews who fix power lines. The Extended Look shows it parked, with its outriggers out.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=International%204700%20Series","reelNom":"International 4700 Series","search":"brute utility truck international 4700 series","thumb":"/img/schemas/brute-utility-truck.svg"},{"id":"declasse-granger-taxi","nom":"Granger Taxi","marque":"Declasse","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Suburban","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The Granger painted as a taxi: a big Suburban topped with the lit sign. It’s the group ride, the one that takes a whole family and their luggage when a sedan isn’t enough. The Extended Look leaves it waiting in front of a hotel entrance.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Suburban","reelNom":"Chevrolet Suburban","search":"declasse granger taxi chevrolet suburban","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-granger-taxi.svg"},{"id":"declasse-sheriff-suv","nom":"Sheriff SUV","marque":"Declasse","cat":"service","st":"comm","insp":"Sheriff’s Chevrolet Tahoe","txt":"The sheriff’s office SUV, used outside city limits. The split between city police and county sheriff shapes the map of Leonida as much as the geography does.","search":"declasse sheriff suv chevrolet tahoe de sherif","src":"Community match","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Tahoe%20de%20sh%C3%A9rif","reelNom":"Sheriff’s Chevrolet Tahoe","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/declasse-sheriff-suv.svg"},{"id":"dundreary-police-landstalker-xl","nom":"Police Landstalker XL","marque":"Dundreary","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Fourth-generation Lincoln Navigator","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A big SUV in police colors, based on the civilian Landstalker XL. A vehicle this size is rarely used for chases: US police departments keep it for supervision, moving teams and bulky gear. Spotted in the Extended Look.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Lincoln%20Navigator","reelNom":"Lincoln Navigator","search":"dundreary police landstalker xl lincoln navigator quatrieme generation","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/dundreary-police-landstalker-xl.svg"},{"id":"hvy-airtug","nom":"Airtug","marque":"HVY","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Clark CT30","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The little tow tractor that pulls baggage carts between the terminal and the plane’s hold. Its shape comes from the Clark CT30, an airport machine nobody ever notices but that drives all over the tarmac. The Extended Look catches it at work at Leonida’s airport.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Clark%20CT30","reelNom":"Clark CT30","search":"hvy airtug clark ct30","thumb":"/img/schemas/hvy-airtug.svg"},{"id":"hvy-biff","nom":"Biff","marque":"HVY","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Kenworth T800","src":"Extended Look","txt":"HVY’s dump truck, built on a short-cab Kenworth T800 chassis. It hauls gravel and dirt from one construction site to the next, and it’s heavy enough to roll through an intersection without slowing down. The Extended Look puts it on a work site.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Kenworth%20T800","reelNom":"Kenworth T800","search":"hvy biff kenworth t800","thumb":"/img/schemas/hvy-biff.svg"},{"id":"hvy-forklift","nom":"Forklift","marque":"HVY","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Yale GLP060VX","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The forklift of warehouses and loading docks, modeled on a Yale GLP060VX. Slow, low to the ground, unable to get over a curb, but essential as soon as you need to move a pallet. The official screenshots place it in an industrial area.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Yale%20GLP060VX","reelNom":"Yale GLP060VX","search":"hvy forklift yale glp060vx","thumb":"/img/schemas/hvy-forklift.svg"},{"id":"jacksheepe-excavator","nom":"Excavator","marque":"Jacksheepe","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Liebherr R954B HD-S, Samsung SE280LC-2","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Jacksheepe’s tracked excavator, a mix of a Liebherr R954B HD-S and a Samsung SE280LC-2. Swiveling turret, articulated arm, a bucket wide enough to flip a sedan without breaking a sweat. The Extended Look puts it to work on an earthmoving job.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Liebherr%20R954B%20HD-S","reelNom":"Liebherr R954B HD-S","search":"jacksheepe excavator liebherr r954b hd-s, samsung se280lc-2","thumb":"/img/schemas/jacksheepe-excavator.svg"},{"id":"mtl-flatbed","nom":"Flatbed","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"2004 Freightliner Century Class 112","src":"Extended Look","search":"jobuilt flatbed 2004 freightliner century class 112","txt":"The Flatbed is a flatbed truck, used to haul vehicles or bulky loads. Our database credits this version to JoBuilt and matches it with the 2004 Freightliner Century Class 112. The Extended Look shows it carrying a wreck, with its bed tilted.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=2004%20Freightliner%20Century%20Class%20112","reelNom":"2004 Freightliner Century Class 112","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/mtl-flatbed.svg"},{"id":"jobuilt-hauler","nom":"Hauler","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Freightliner and Kenworth semi trucks","src":"Official screenshots","search":"jobuilt hauler tracteurs routiers freightliner et kenworth","txt":"The Hauler is a semi truck, the part of an 18-wheeler that pulls the trailer. JoBuilt is the GTA universe’s heavy-equipment brand. The port of Vice City and the roads heading up to northern Leonida are this kind of vehicle’s natural turf. The official screenshots show it hitched up, ready to hit the road again.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Tracteurs%20routiers%20Freightliner","reelNom":"Freightliner semi trucks","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/jobuilt-hauler.svg"},{"id":"jobuilt-phantom","nom":"Phantom","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Peterbilt 359 EXHD","src":"Trailer 1","search":"jobuilt phantom peterbilt 359 exhd","txt":"The Phantom is a long-cab semi truck, the kind that crosses the US from coast to coast with a sleeper behind the seats. Trailer 1 shows it passing on a highway.","medias":["trailer-1-phantom-003"],"imageAlts":{"trailer-1-phantom-003":"Semi truck pulling a Patriot trailer in the middle of the expressway, GTA VI Trailer 1 around 00:03."},"reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Peterbilt%20359%20EXHD","reelNom":"Peterbilt 359 EXHD","thumb":"/img/officiel/trailer-1-phantom-003-480.webp"},{"id":"jobuilt-phantom-custom","nom":"Phantom Custom","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"1984 GMC General with a faired sleeper cab","src":"Official screenshots","search":"jobuilt phantom custom gmc general 1984 a cabine couchette carenee","txt":"A customized version of the Phantom: chrome, extra lights, detailed paint job. Decked-out truck culture is alive and well in the US, where the truck often belongs to the driver. The official screenshots show it parked at a rest area.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=GMC%20General%201984%20%C3%A0%20cabine%20couchette%20car%C3%A9n%C3%A9e","reelNom":"1984 GMC General with a faired sleeper cab","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/jobuilt-phantom-custom.svg"},{"id":"jobuilt-rubble","nom":"Rubble","marque":"JoBuilt","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Peterbilt 359 EXHD","txt":"A four-axle dump truck. Construction sites are part of Vice City’s urban landscape, with machines that really drive around instead of just sitting there.","search":"jobuilt rubble peterbilt 359 exhd","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Peterbilt%20359%20EXHD","reelNom":"Peterbilt 359 EXHD","thumb":"/img/schemas/jobuilt-rubble.svg"},{"id":"maibatsu-mule","nom":"Mule","marque":"Maibatsu","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Seventh-generation Mitsubishi Fuso Canter","txt":"A box truck built on a Japanese cab. The Mule is the series’ standard delivery and moving truck.","search":"maibatsu mule mitsubishi fuso canter septieme generation","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Mitsubishi%20Fuso%20Canter","reelNom":"Mitsubishi Fuso Canter","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/maibatsu-mule.svg"},{"id":"airport-bus","nom":"Airport Bus","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The shuttle that loops around the terminals, with wide doors and a long center aisle for standing travelers, suitcase at their feet. The manufacturer is still unknown and no real model has been identified so far. The Extended Look shows it serving Vice City’s airport.","fam":"Airport shuttle","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Navette%20d%E2%80%99a%C3%A9roport","reelNom":"Airport shuttle","search":"marque inconnue airport bus navette d’aeroport","thumb":"/img/schemas/airport-bus.svg"},{"id":"amloco-ge-genesis","nom":"Amloco (GE Genesis)","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"GE Genesis locomotive","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"Amloco, Leonida’s rail company, pulls its passenger trains with a locomotive modeled on the GE Genesis: rounded nose, monocoque body, light-colored livery. It’s the engine for intercity routes, not freight. The official screenshots frame it at a platform.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Locomotive%20GE%20Genesis","reelNom":"GE Genesis locomotive","search":"marque inconnue amloco (ge genesis) locomotive ge genesis","thumb":"/img/schemas/amloco-ge-genesis.svg"},{"id":"dashound","nom":"Dashound","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"MCI Renaissance E coach, Greyhound livery","src":"Trailer 1","search":"marque inconnue dashound autocar mci renaissance e, livree greyhound","txt":"The Dashound intercity coach is a series staple, a take on a very real American bus company whose emblem is a greyhound. That network serves thousands of towns that planes and trains have left behind. Trailer 1 shows it driving on the highway, with its full livery in view.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Autocar%20MCI%20Renaissance%20E","reelNom":"Autocar MCI Renaissance E","thumb":"/img/schemas/dashound.svg"},{"id":"isuzu-elf-250","nom":"Elf 250","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Isuzu Elf 250","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Isuzu’s small cab-over truck, found everywhere in city deliveries around the world. Cab sitting above the engine, box in the back, tiny turning radius. The in-game name hasn’t been announced yet. It appears in the Extended Look.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Isuzu%20Elf%20250","reelNom":"Isuzu Elf 250","search":"marque inconnue elf 250 isuzu elf 250","slot":"japonais","thumb":"/img/schemas/isuzu-elf-250.svg"},{"id":"vapid-caracara-lifeguard","nom":"Explorer Sport Trac (Lifeguard)","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Explorer Sport Trac","txt":"A beach patrol pickup in a lifeguard livery, with the gear strapped down in the back. The Sport Trac was an Explorer where Ford swapped the cargo area for a short bed, built from 2000 to 2010. Miami Beach lifeguard stations used them for years. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue explorer sport trac (lifeguard) ford explorer sport trac","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Explorer%20Sport%20Trac","reelNom":"Ford Explorer Sport Trac","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-caracara-lifeguard.svg"},{"id":"ford-f-series-tow-truck","nom":"F-Series tow truck","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford F-Series, tow truck configuration","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A tow truck built on a Ford F-Series base, with the hydraulic arm and winch out in the open at the back. Rockstar hasn’t given it an in-game name or a fictional brand yet. The Extended Look shows it on a job, with a wrecked vehicle at the end of the cable.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-Series","reelNom":"Ford F-Series","search":"marque inconnue f-series depanneuse ford f-series, configuration depanneuse","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-f-series-tow-truck.svg"},{"id":"ford-f-series-flatbed","nom":"F-Series flatbed","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Ford F-Series","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A sixth-generation Ford F-Series converted into a flatbed truck: the original bed swapped for a bare deck to haul bulky equipment. A common conversion in farming and construction. In-game name not announced.","search":"marque inconnue f-series plateau ford f-series sixieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20F-Series","reelNom":"Ford F-Series","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-f-series-flatbed.svg"},{"id":"freight-train","nom":"Freight Train","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Electro Motive Division, GE AC4400CW","txt":"A freight train. The rail network runs across Leonida between industrial zones, ports and city centers, with railroad crossings that really do block the road.","search":"marque inconnue freight train electro motive division, ge ac4400cw","src":"Official screenshots","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Electro%20Motive%20Division","reelNom":"Electro Motive Division","thumb":"/img/schemas/freight-train.svg"},{"id":"chevrolet-kodiak-gmc-topkick","nom":"Kodiak / Topkick","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Kodiak, GMC Topkick","src":"Extended Look","txt":"General Motors’ medium-duty truck, sold under both the Chevrolet Kodiak and GMC Topkick badges, with a short hood and a chrome grille. It has been given neither an in-game name nor an in-universe maker. The Extended Look shows it set up for construction work.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Kodiak","reelNom":"Chevrolet Kodiak","search":"marque inconnue kodiak / topkick chevrolet kodiak, gmc topkick","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chevrolet-kodiak-gmc-topkick.svg"},{"id":"international-s-series-semi-truck","nom":"S-Series","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"International S-Series, semi truck","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"An International S-Series semi truck, recognizable by its square grille and its tall cab sitting above the engine. It hasn’t been given an in-game name or a fictional manufacturer. Trailer 2 sends it down the highway with its trailer hooked up.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=International%20S-Series","reelNom":"International S-Series","search":"marque inconnue s-series international s-series, tracteur routier","thumb":"/img/schemas/international-s-series-semi-truck.svg"},{"id":"chevrolet-silverado-6500-hd","nom":"Silverado 6500 HD","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Chevrolet Silverado 6500 HD","src":"Extended Look","txt":"A medium-duty truck, well beyond a private owner’s pickup: a chassis cab meant for work bodies, like a tow truck, a dump bed or a flatbed. Spotted in the Extended Look. Its in-game name hasn’t been announced.","search":"marque inconnue silverado 6500 hd chevrolet silverado 6500 hd","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Chevrolet%20Silverado%206500%20HD","reelNom":"Chevrolet Silverado 6500 HD","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/chevrolet-silverado-6500-hd.svg"},{"id":"dodge-grand-caravan-taxi","nom":"Taxi Grand Caravan","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Dodge Grand Caravan 2011-2020, Chrysler Town & Country 2011-2016","src":"Official screenshots","txt":"The minivan in taxi livery, based on the Dodge Grand Caravan and its cousin, the Chrysler Town & Country. In Miami, these yellow vans handle the airport runs, sliding doors open and trunk full of suitcases. The official screenshots catch it in traffic.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Dodge%20Grand%20Caravan","reelNom":"Dodge Grand Caravan","search":"marque inconnue taxi grand caravan dodge grand caravan 2011-2020, chrysler town & country 2011-2016","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/dodge-grand-caravan-taxi.svg"},{"id":"mtl-packer","nom":"Packer","marque":"MTL","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"1994 International 9000/9200","src":"Trailer 2","search":"mtl packer 1994 international 9000/9200","txt":"The Packer is a car carrier rig, used to haul new or impounded vehicles. Its two-level trailer makes it instantly recognizable. It’s listed from Trailer 2 under a community identification, with no name announced by the studio.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=1994%20International%209000%2F9200","reelNom":"1994 International 9000/9200","thumb":"/img/schemas/mtl-packer.svg"},{"id":"nagasaki-caddy","nom":"Caddy","marque":"Nagasaki","cat":"service","st":"vu","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Nagasaki’s golf cart, slow and indestructible, is back in a setting made for it: Leonida’s well-kept golf courses. No specific real-world model is tied to it, which makes sense for such a generic vehicle. The Extended Look shows it driving between two holes.","fam":"Golf cart","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Voiturette%20de%20golf","reelNom":"Golf cart","search":"nagasaki caddy voiturette de golf","thumb":"/img/schemas/nagasaki-caddy.svg"},{"id":"vapid-benson","nom":"Benson","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"International 4700 Delivery Truck Chassis","txt":"A mid-size box truck, bigger than the Mule and easier to handle than a semi. It’s traditionally used for heists that need cargo space.","search":"vapid benson international 4700 delivery truck chassis","src":"Extended Look","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=International%204700%20Delivery%20Truck%20Chassis","reelNom":"International 4700 Delivery Truck Chassis","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-benson.svg"},{"id":"vapid-police-cruiser-interceptor","nom":"Police Cruiser (Interceptor)","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Taurus","txt":"A patrol SUV that became the standard for American police in the 2010s, replacing the sedan. Bigger cargo space, higher ground clearance.","search":"vapid police cruiser (interceptor) ford taurus","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Taurus","reelNom":"Ford Taurus","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-police-cruiser-interceptor.svg"},{"id":"vapid-police-cruiser-stanier-le","nom":"Police Cruiser (Stanier LE)","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Crown Victoria","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"A classic patrol car, built on the Stanier LE. The Crown Victoria served almost every American police department for twenty years: body-on-frame chassis, rear-wheel drive, cheap to fix after a crash. Don’t confuse it with the Police Ghost, which uses the same base under a stealth livery.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Crown%20Victoria","reelNom":"Ford Crown Victoria","search":"vapid police cruiser (stanier le) ford crown victoria","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-police-cruiser-stanier-le.svg"},{"id":"vapid-police-ghost","nom":"Police Ghost (Stanier LE)","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Crown Victoria","src":"Trailer 2","txt":"Vice City’s classic patrol car, built on the Stanier. The Crown Victoria whose looks it borrows was the standard American police car for more than twenty years: rear-wheel drive, body-on-frame, indestructible. The name Ghost refers to unmarked units, whose livery you can only make out once you’re too close.","search":"vapid police ghost (stanier le) ford crown victoria","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Crown%20Victoria","reelNom":"Ford Crown Victoria","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-police-ghost.svg"},{"id":"ford-explorer-police","nom":"Police Montagne","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Sixth-generation Ford Explorer","src":"Trailer 1","txt":"Since the 2010s, the patrol SUV has replaced the sedan in most American police departments: a deeper trunk, more ground clearance, a better view over traffic. The police Montagne takes that shape and shows up as early as Trailer 1, in the streets of Vice City.","search":"vapid police montagne ford explorer sixieme generation","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Explorer","reelNom":"Ford Explorer","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/ford-explorer-police.svg"},{"id":"vapid-taxi","nom":"Stanier Taxi","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"Ford Crown Victoria","txt":"The Crown Victoria in taxi livery, with checkers down the sides and a sign on the roof. It’s the ultimate fleet sedan: huge trunk, ladder-frame chassis, bulletproof mechanicals that are cheap to maintain. Trailer 1 shows it driving through Vice City traffic.","search":"vapid stanier taxi ford crown victoria","src":"Trailer 1","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Ford%20Crown%20Victoria","reelNom":"Ford Crown Victoria","slot":"americain","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-taxi.svg"},{"id":"vapid-tow-truck","nom":"Tow Truck","marque":"Vapid","cat":"service","st":"vu","insp":"80s International Harvester S-Series","src":"Trailer 1","search":"vapid tow truck international harvester serie s des annees 80","txt":"Flatbed and boom tow trucks are part of the American city landscape, from roadside assistance to hauling away illegally parked cars. The source used for this Tow Truck is Trailer 1, where the vehicle isn’t named.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=International%20Harvester%20s%C3%A9rie%20S%20des%20ann%C3%A9es%2080","reelNom":"80s International Harvester S-Series","thumb":"/img/schemas/vapid-tow-truck.svg"},{"id":"endurex-race-bike","nom":"Race Bike","marque":"Endurex","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"Pinarello Dogma","src":"Extended Look","txt":"Endurex’s competition road bike, designed after a Pinarello Dogma: carbon frame with asymmetric stays, drop handlebars, deep-section rims. It’s the fastest non-motorized two-wheeler in the game. The Extended Look catches it with a rider going all out.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Pinarello%20Dogma","reelNom":"Pinarello Dogma","search":"endurex race bike pinarello dogma","thumb":"/img/schemas/endurex-race-bike.svg"},{"id":"bmx","nom":"BMX","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"BMX bike","src":"Official screenshots","search":"marque inconnue bmx bmx bike","txt":"The bike is right there on screen; its name, nowhere. This small-wheeled bike, born in the 70s from California kids imitating motocross, has become an Olympic sport. Miami’s ramp parks make it a believable city vehicle as much as a toy.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BMX%20bike","reelNom":"BMX bike","thumb":"/img/schemas/bmx.svg"},{"id":"cruiser","nom":"Cruiser","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"Beach cruiser, ’30s beach bike","src":"Official screenshots","search":"marque inconnue cruiser beach cruiser, velo de plage des annees 30","txt":"The beach bike with high handlebars and a wide saddle can be spotted in the images, with no caption attached. It’s the very picture of coastal Florida: no gears, an upright riding position, and wide tires for rolling on the packed sand of the beach promenades.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Beach%20cruiser","reelNom":"Beach cruiser","thumb":"/img/schemas/cruiser.svg"},{"id":"lombike","nom":"LomBike","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"CitiBike Miami E-Bikes","src":"Official screenshots","search":"marque inconnue lombike citibike miami e-bikes","txt":"A utility city bike, with no sporty pretensions. This kind of bicycle is mostly used for short trips and local deliveries. For now, its presence is only an assumption.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=CitiBike%20Miami%20E-Bikes","reelNom":"CitiBike Miami E-Bikes","thumb":"/img/schemas/lombike.svg"},{"id":"monorail-de-vice-city","nom":"Vice City Monorail","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"Innovia APM 100, Miami Metromover","src":"Trailer 2","search":"marque inconnue monorail de vice city innovia apm 100, metromover de miami","txt":"The urban monorail is a Miami specialty: since the 80s, the city has run an automated elevated network serving downtown. This kind of transit, rare in the United States, is part of the city’s visual identity. Our database links this monorail to Trailer 2 and uses the Metromover’s Innovia APM 100 as its inspiration.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Innovia%20APM%20100","reelNom":"Innovia APM 100","thumb":"/img/schemas/monorail-de-vice-city.svg"},{"id":"scorcher","nom":"Scorcher","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"Saracen Zen, Rockshox Domain 180mm","src":"Official screenshots","search":"marque inconnue scorcher saracen zen, rockshox domain 180mm","txt":"A mountain bike with suspension, the Scorcher is made for trails and parks rather than the road. Mount Kalaga National Park, listed on our map, is exactly the kind of place where this type of bike comes into its own. The official screenshots show it leaning against a low wall.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Saracen%20Zen","reelNom":"Saracen Zen","thumb":"/img/schemas/scorcher.svg"},{"id":"electric-scooter","nom":"Electric scooter","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"BIRD One","src":"Extended Look","txt":"The shared rental electric scooter, copied from the BIRD One you find dumped on every sidewalk in Miami. Low deck, straight handlebar, short range and capped speed. The Extended Look lines up several of them at a rental dock.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=BIRD%20One","reelNom":"BIRD One","search":"marque inconnue trottinette electrique bird one","thumb":"/img/schemas/electric-scooter.svg"},{"id":"vcia-train","nom":"VCIA Train","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"comm","insp":null,"src":"Community match","search":"marque inconnue vcia train navette automatique d’aeroport","txt":"The shuttle that links the terminals is still a community hypothesis, with no known name. These driverless trains are standard infrastructure at big American airports, and Vice City’s international airport is on our map.","fam":"Automated airport shuttle","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Navette%20automatique%20d%E2%80%99a%C3%A9roport","reelNom":"Automated airport shuttle","thumb":"/img/schemas/vcia-train.svg"},{"id":"vcmm-train","nom":"VCMM Train","marque":"Unknown brand","cat":"divers","st":"vu","insp":"Miami Metrorail","src":"Trailer 2","search":"marque inconnue vcmm train metrorail de miami","txt":"Vice City’s urban train stands out on screen, but its name hasn’t been published. Our map lists several stations, including the airport station and the Vice City Arts Center station, which suggests a network that actually serves the city rather than just set dressing.","reel":"https://www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&q=Metrorail%20de%20Miami","reelNom":"Miami Metrorail","thumb":"/img/schemas/vcmm-train.svg"}];
